<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUKE Nouveau Testament en Langue Ipunu</book>
  <para style="rem">Projet KIWOYETI</para>
  <para style="rem">Langue: Ipunu, Yipunu, Yipounou, Ipounou, Punu, Pounou.</para>
  <para style="rem">Membres de l'Equipe: W. KOMBILA MATAMBA; R.Françoise BOUKANDOU; Bédienne MANOMBA NZAMBA; Jacques MOUDOUMA; Blaise KOMBILA MAMBOUNDOU;</para>
  <para style="rem">Réviseurs: André Paul KOMBILE KOMBILE Bastho; Julie MOUBOUENGOU; Alain Edouard Faël DOUKAGA MACKOBOU; Honorine BOUKANDOU;</para>
  <para style="rem">Conseiller: Paul D. HUMBER</para>
  <para style="rem">© CIEATLG LIBREVILLE 2024; Seed Company</para>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Musamu Wuboti wu Luke</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musamu Wuboti wu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luke</para>
  <para style="imt">Yilombi yiboti nane Luke amayisonine</para>
  <para style="im">Djabeni asamabe muSwife. Dingenze wandi Luke asamabe mu durangu du dighumi na badukitsi babedji (12) ba Djesu, tumbe djandi amayenewendaaange na Pole mu milingu na amayenemuwamusaange mu yisalu yandi. Yike Luke emani urende musamu andi, akebwérende mughande wu bisalu bi bilumbi. Amabande musamu andi novose yiri erondi utsingule kengili mambu motsu amarendu mu Djesu. Amamarendile mu baSwife na mu djowu abagha baSwife mumbari bakedjabe yiri motsu amebamabatsingule mangenze. Luke amamwélonze pwele mambu amevosi mu durondu du Djesu, diwendili rye: «Durondu mu bidjaghe, mu bikoyi, mu baghetu na mu beni.»</para>
  <para style="is">Butsighe bu Musamu Wuboti wu Luke</para>
  <para style="im">Labanu nane musamu wu Luke wumarendulu na nane wumaghabulu mu yisambwali yi kapu.</para>
  <para style="ib"/>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-2:52">1.1—2.52</ref></char> Mu kapu tsyeni tsibedji, Luke evosi mu duburu du San-Batise, mu duburu na bungebi bu Djesu. Ebwétsingule nane Mari, Sakari na Simewu bamayitsilaange Nzambi. Mambu meni, mambu amaghamarendu mu misamu misusu.</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-4:13">3.1—4.13</ref></char> Mu kapu atsine, Luke etsinguli nane San-Batise amaruyile muyitsonzighe nzile Djesu, nane Djesu amabatusulu na San-Batise mbana nane dyabu amamangile Djesu.</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4.14—9.50</ref></char> Amune, Luke evosi nane Djesu amasalile o musyengi Ngalile na nane amalonzilaange mbembu Nzambi nobelusaange bibedu.</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:28">9.51—19.28</ref></char> Mu kapu tsyeni tsine, Luke etsinguli nane Djesu amadusuyile musyengi Ngalile mu uwende o Serusaleme. Mu yibuku yeni yine, Luke emwévose pwele bighume abighaa mu misamu misusu na mambu motsu ame Djesu amavosaange na banongu. Diwendili: nongu dji mungo yingebe, nongu dji yisine yi yiduke na nongu dji mwane awumayekwake na amaghabusile.</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:29-21:38">19.29—21.38</ref></char> Mu kapu tsyeni tsine, Luke evosi mu bimaghe abi Djesu amavaghe o Serusaleme na ame amalonze wune.</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22:1-23:56">22.1—23.56</ref></char> Mu kapu tsyeni, Luke evosi mu ditsoghe na dufu du Djesu na ebwévose nane Djesu amarambuyile o dufu na nane amalabinine na badukitsi bandi.</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24">24</ref></char> Mu kapu dji nzitu, Luke emanisili musamu andi na etulasi nane Djesu amaghabuyile vo amamatile o djulu.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Dibandu di mughande wusonunu Tofile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Mundumbe Tofile, batu bapwele bamamaange urende mambu amamalabene va ghari etu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Bamarende nane dimatutsingululu na bambedji abamalabe na misu, vane dibandu, na abamaveghu mufune ulonze musamu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Nyimalabe yi diwelimine mewami, mu rombe burange mu motsu amamavyoghe ubongile va dibandu, mu wusonighile dyoni, mundumbe Tofile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Nyighurendili mambu meni, mumbari wukedjabe yi malongi ame wumadile mangenze.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yanze amayétsingule duburu du San-Batise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Mu temu adji Yirode amabilaange kaghe dji Sudé, wukebe muvaghulitsi paghu amanengulungu Sakari. Amabe mu dibuli di bavaghulitsi ba paghu di Abya. Mughatsi andi Lisabete, amabe mu kule dji Arone. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Sakari na mughatsi andi, bamabangaange basungeme va wusu Nzambi na bamaghobisaange mighaghe myotsu na marume motsu ma Fumu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Tumbe basamabe na baane mumbari Lisabete amabe yingume, na djowubotsu babedji mbé bake binunu.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Mwa yilumbu Sakari amasalilaange Nzambi, mumba temu dyandi dibuli di bavaghulitsi ba paghu mbé djimatole. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Mu nzalusulu bavaghulitsi ba paghu, Sakari akesolu mu ukote o ghari yibuku ayi syeme yi Fumu mu yenyenze bime bi mbunge djiboti. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>O dulombili, yinombu yi batu yikesambilaange mu temu adji Sakari amawendile mu uyébinyenze. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Vane-vane, yanze yi Fumu yikesundughe na yikelabene na Sakari wune ghari ndaghu, diteli o mabaale ma yivaghululu yi paghu. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Ave amayilabile, akeregheme na akebe na ghome djineni. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Tumbe yanze yikemutsingule rye: «Sakari uyabe na ghome, mumbari Nzambi amawulu dusambu dwaghu. Mughatsi aghu Lisabete owuburile mwane dibaale, na wumulughe San. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Mwane eni obe nzangu o murime aghu na bapwele wandi bobase na nzangu mu duburu dwandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Mumbari obe musatsi wuneni wu Fumu. Djandi, aghonwaangange malamu amelanzi. Ne akeburu, obasu na Yinyuni Yisyeme. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Oghabuse mirime mipwele mi bise Yisrayele ombu Fumu Nzambi owu. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Orughe nane yilumbi yi Nzambi abasu na Yinyuni na mangolu ma Eli mubiyitsi Nzambi. Oghabuse dinonge va ghari baane na batadji bowu na obeghe bango dilenze o dighobe di batu abasungeme. Otsonzighe mukute awube uwelimine mu uduke Fumu.» <verse eid="LUK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Tumbe Sakari akewivule yanze rye: «Tsyeni nyudjabile yiri dyoni dingenze? Mumbari menu na mughatsi ami tuke binunu.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Yanze yike muwaghule rye: «Menu, la Ghabiryele, nyidji va wusu Nzambi na nyimusalili, atsinzindighe mu uyighuvosile na mu udjabise musamu wuboti. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Kaboghu wube dibabe, kwange na temu adji mambu meni molabinine, mumba wughasinge mambu ame nziwutsingule, amodughusu mu temu adjimasikughu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Vane yanze amavosilaange nandi, abamabe o dulombili bamavivaange Sakari, bakekambulu mu yitsingu yandi o ghari ndaghu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Na epali, asamabwérunguse wuvosile batu, na djowu baketase bwena Sakari amadile dulasu o ghari ndaghu eni. Akebavosilaange yike na milembu mumbari mbé ake dibabe.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Sakari na emani bilumbu byandi byusalile Nzambi, akeghabughe o ndaghu andi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Mu temu adjimadukaange, mughatsi andi Lisabete akabe na dimi na akesweme o ndaghu andi mu miweli miranu. Akevosaange rye: <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>«Labanu yese ayi Fumu amalase mu menu, amaghusule yisoni yami va wusu batu botsu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yanze yitsinguli duburu du Djesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Mu muweli awu musyamunu wu dimi di Lisabete, Nzambi akesindighe yanze Ghabiryele o musyengi Nasarete mu yinange yi Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Wune, wumabe tsyemi dji mughetu omabe yibande yi dibaale dimanengulungu Sosefe, awu amabe mu yifumbe yi Davide. Na tsyemi eni, dine dyandi Mari. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Yanze yikerasune Mari o ghari ndaghu andi na yikemusimbe rye: «Mbolwa Mari! Fumu adji naghu amawubase na myule.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Mari amaregheme na akekambulu mu munongu mbolu adji yanze amamuveghe, na vane-vane, akekéwivulaange divindughulu di mbolu eni. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Yanze yikemutsingule rye: «Wuyalabe ghome Mari, wumadile yese yi Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Na mapape, wube na dimi na wubure mwane dibaale awulughe Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Djandi obe muneni na onengulu Mwane Nzambi-Pungu. Fumu Nzambi omubyatse kaghe nane Davide kule andi abilaange. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Na djandi obyamaange mutubu na mutubu mu mukute Sakobe, na bukaghe bwandi bughobe tena disukusulu.» <verse eid="LUK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Mari akewivule yanze rye: «Dyoni tsyeni dyurungulile ubile, menu awu nyikivu tsyemi?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Yanze yike muwaghule rye: «Yinyuni Yisyeme yurughe mu ndedju na mangolu ma Nzambi-Pungu mowughumbe. Ladibandu mwane awubure wube wusyeme, onengulu Mwane Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Lisabete yiburu yaghu ne nane ake yinunu, djawandi ekelisi ubure mwane andi dibaale. Djandi awu bamanengilaange yingume ake na dimi di miweli misyamunu. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Mumbari vagha dyambu divure ombu Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Mu dyoni, Mari akevose rye: «Nyidji musatsi Fumu, kaboghu motsu madughusu nane wutsivosile.» Na yanze yikemusile.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mari elinguli Lisabete yiburu yandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Mu bilumbu abimadukaange, Mari amareleme nowende mbangu-mbangu o mikongu o musyengi yinange yi Sudé. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Anokote o ndaghu Sakari, akesimbe Lisabete. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Lisabete anowulu mbolu Mari, mwane andi akekunge o ghari modji andi. Vane-vane, Lisabete akebase na Yinyuni Yisyeme. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Na akebwaghe mughamu wuneni novose rye: «Mari, Nzambi amawupuyile myule wuvyoghulile baghetu botsu na mwane wandi amadile myule o modji aghu!» <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Mu dyoni, Lisabete akewivule rye: «Tembusu menu yi nyivu, mulabene na ngudji Fumu ami? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Labati, ave nyiwululu mbolu aghu, mwane nosangughe na nzangu o modji ami. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Mari, myule ombu ndedju awutsisinge mambu amanziwulu mumbari Fumu omadughusu nane amavosile.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwimbu du Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Mari akevose rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Nyuyitsaange Fumu, mu monyu ami wotsu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>na nyibase na nzangu mu Nzambi, Mughobutsi ami.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Nyudivaghanga, mumbari amatsune tembusu menu musatsi andi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Kaboghu, ubandile na muni, kule na kule bondengilaange mughetu myule,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>mumbari Nzambi Mangolu amapayile mambu amaneni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Dine dyandi disyeme,<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>na yingebe yandi yubangage kule na kule</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">mu djowu abemudumi.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Amalase mambu maneni na mangolu mandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">amapanze bango dunangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>amarambuse bakaghe mu bitsighe byowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">na amabyatse abakesunze.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Amabase maboti ombu bango nzale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">na akeghabuse bisine myowu na myowu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Amawamuse Yisrayele, musalitsi andi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">asamalibene ulase yingebe yandi,<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>nane amavangenine na bakule betu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">ombu Aberaame na bateghule bandi mutubu na mutubu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mari akevyose miweli miryeru ombu Lisabete, mbana akeghabughe o dimbu dyandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Duburu du San-Batise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Temu ubure djinotole, Lisabete akebure mwane dibaale. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Biburu na bambatsi ba dimbu na bédjabi bwena Fumu amalase yingebe yandi ombu Lisabete, bakeyésaghe va mosi nandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Yisambwali yi bilumbu yinovyoghe, ayi munane, bamarughe mu yirebe mwane na bamaronde umunengile Sakari nane tadji andi. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Tumbe ngudji andi akevose rye: «Nesi, onengulu San.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Batu beni bakemuwaghule rye: «Mu biburu byaghu, vagha mutu amanengulungu mu dine dyeni dine.» <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Na bamaghebule tadji andi mu muwivule tsyeni onengilile mwane andi. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Sakari akevonde yasi yi dusimbi na akerende rye: «San la dine dyandi.» Na botsu bamakambulu. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Vane-vane, mbembu andi djikepandughe, akebande wuvose na akedodise Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Ghome djimabase mu botsu abamabe mu mighule. Mu mikongu myotsu mi Sudé, bakevosaange bilombi bi mambu meni. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Botsu abamadiwulu, bakedikelulaange: «Munongu mwane yi obe?» Dingenze, Fumu amabe nandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwimbu du Sakari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Sakari, tadji mwane eni, anobe abasu na Yinyuni Yisyeme, akebighe rye:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Duyitsu ombu Fumu Nzambi dji Yisrayele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">Djandi, amayilingule noghobule mukute andi.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Amatutindile Mughobutsi mangolu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">va ghari bateghule ba Davide, musalitsi andi,<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>nane amavosile va kale mu babiyitsi bandi basyeme.<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Mutudjeyise ombu bavinitsi, notukawule va makake ma bambeni betu.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Anane amalasile yingebe yandi ombu baghulu betu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">akerangimine yivighu yandi yisyeme.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Anane Nzambi amaghanine kaka ombu Aberaame tadji etu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>mu tugharusu wumusalile na mangolu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">payi tumaghobughe va makake ma bavinitsi betu.<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Tukebangaange tuwelimine na tusyeme va wusu andi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">bilumbu byotsu bi monyu etu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Na ndedju mwane kali, unengulungu “Mubiyitsi wu Nzambi-Pungu”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">mumbari, uyenewendaange va wusu Fumu mu tsonzighe manzile mandi,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>udjabise mukute andi dughobutsu dwandi na dutandu du mabi mandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Yine, Nzambi mu yingebe na durondu dwandi, osunduse mu djetu, yidjalale yandi ayivu nane dimengi di nyangu adiruyili o djulu.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Oyimonitse botsu abetsani otsi piseme na mu yidumbitsi yi dufu, mu tusungighe mu nzile duvotsu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Mwane eni amaneghaange nowarange mu Yinyuni. Amatsanaange mu bakumu, kwange na yilumbu ayi amapalile va ghari mughungi wu Yisrayele.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Duburu du Djesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Ave Sesare Okisete amabyamilaange nane kaghe dji Rome, amarume dutalu du batu mu malongu mandi motsu. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Sanzeme eni djiteghe, djimabile ave Kirinuse amabile yidjeti yi yinange yi Siri. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Batu botsu bamerendusungu kale mutu o dyandi dimbu. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Sosefe djawandi, amaghusughe yinange yi Ngalile o musyengi Nasarete noghabughe o musyengi kaghe Davide awinengulu Beteleme, o yinange yi Sudé. Mumbari amabe muteghule andi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Akeyerendusu djawandi na Mari yibande yandi omabe na dimi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Ave bamabile wune Beteleme, temu Mari djubure djiketole.<verse eid="LUK 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Akebure mwane andi tsomi wu dibaale, akemupote mu tsande nomusilighe o ghari yililu yi bindombu, mumbari basamadile yitsighe o ndaghu beni.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yanze yilabini na bakelisili ba bindombu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Wune yari yeni, vamabe bakelitsi ba bindombu bamavyosaange mikolu o kumu mu ukelisaange mighambe myowu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Yanze yi Fumu yimalabene nowu na yidjalale yi kembu andi yikebaghumbe. Bakebase na ghome. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Tumbe yanze yimabasiyighe mirime rye: «Duyabe na ghome, mumbari nyidubeyili musamu wuboti awulase batu botsu ubwedji. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Na mukolu ewuwu, o musyengi Davide Mughobutsi amaduburulu, djandi la Kirisete, Fumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Lanu yilimbe ayi dumudjabile: durasunu mwane kali wupotu tsande na wusilughu o ghari yililulu yi bindombu.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Vane-vane, yinombu yi byanze bi djulu bimalabene. Bikedodisaange Nzambi rye:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>«Bundumbe ombu Nzambi odjivu o djulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">Duvotsu ombu bise tsi abe djandi erondi.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakelisili ba bindombu bewendi o Beteleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Byanze binobasile mu ughabughe o djulu, bakelitsi ba bindombu bamatsingusene: «Twendyanu teno Beteleme mu uyélabe dyambu diboti adimarughe wune adi Fumu amatudjabise.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Bamawende maswasu, na bamarasune Mari na Sosefe na mwane kali wusilughu mu yililu yi bindombu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Bakelitsi ba bindombu banomulabe, bakevose ame yanze amabatsingule mu mwane eni. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Botsu abamawulu mo bakelitsi beni bamavose, bamasutu. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Tumbe Mari amaghangise mambu meni motsu nomarangiminaange temu tsyotsu. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Vane-vane bamayeneghabughe, bakenedodisaange nowimbilaange mu uyitse Nzambi mu motsu ame bamawulu nolabe. Mumbari motsu mamalabene nane yanze amabatsingulile.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Durebu du Djesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Yisambwali yi bilumbu na yivyoghi, ayi munane, bamarebe mwane. Bakemulughe Djesu, nane yanze amabatsingulile ne ngudji andi akabe na dimi. <verse eid="LUK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Na yilumbu yi dulyomusu yitoli nane mughaghe Moyise wivosili, Mari na Sosefe bamabeghe mwane o Serusaleme o ndaghu Nzambi mu uyémuwakise ombu Fumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Dibandu yi dimavaghulungu nane? Mumbari direndu mu mughaghe Fumu rye: «Tsomi tsyotsu tsi babaale tsyuwakusungu ombu Fumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Ukm 13.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Na bovaghulaange «makunde mabedji vo mabembi mabedji<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Lev 12.8</ref></char></note>» nane mughaghe Fumu wirumini.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Vane Serusaleme, vamabe mutu dine dyandi Simewu. Yinyuni Yisyeme yimabe nandi. Amabe asungeme na amadumange Nzambi. Amavivaange dubembughu du baane ba Yisrayele. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Yinyuni Yisyeme, yimamutsingule bwena agholefu payi akalabe Kirisete, Yibyatsi yi Fumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Simewu amabeghusu na Yinyuni mu uwende o ndaghu Nzambi. Va temu adji tadji na ngudji, bamarule na Djesu mu udughusu marume ma mughaghe. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simewu amabonge Djesu va makake mandi. Amayitse Nzambi novose rye:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Fumu tsyesili musalitsi aghu uwende mu duvotsu nane wumavosile.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Nyimalabe Mughobutsi aghu umatutindile, na misu mami.<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Dughobutsu dwaghu adu wumatsonziyile batu botsu.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Djandi obe yidjalale ayudughunu mu malongu motsu, na obe bundumbe bu mukute Yisrayele<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52.10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Simewu ebiyi mu mwane Djesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Tadji na ngudji bakekambulu mu motsu ama Simewu amavosaange mu mwane eni. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simewu anobaveghe myule, amalubuse Mari ngudji Djesu rye: «Mwane eni wuwu obe tonu dji dufundusu du bapwele vo dji dughobutsu du bamosi o Yisrayele. Obe yilimbe yi Nzambi ayi bapwele bobuse. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Tumbe ndebeni, munyongu wuneni wubembe murime aghu. Na matase ma batu molabene kengili va ghari botsu.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ane, mubiyitsi mughetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Vamabe yinunu yi mughetu, abangaange mubiyitsi dine dyandi Ane. Mwane Fanwele mwise yibandu yi Asere. Amatsane yisambwali yi bilime na mulumi andi omamuwele vane bungebi. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Ane asyalilaange mukwili, amatsanaange pinze tena ave amatolisile yinane yi maghumi na bilime bine (84). Asamakakunungu na ndaghu Nzambi mu usalaange nyangu na mukolu, mu uwarilaange nzale nosambilaange. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Anoyitole vane temu eni, amabande uyitse Nzambi. Na djandi amavosilaange mu mwane eni ombu botsu abamavivaange yi Nzambi akeghobule Serusaleme.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu eghabuyi o Nasarete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Biburu bi Djesu banomane udughusu motsu ame mughaghe Fumu wumarumange, bamaghabughe na Djesu o yinange yi Ngalile o yari yi musyengi wu Nasarete. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Mwane amabangughaange nowaraange. Amabe aweele, na yese yi Nzambi yimabe nandi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu mwane ngebi o ndaghu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kadi yilime, biburu bi Djesu bamawendaange o Serusaleme o mumengu Pake. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Djesu anobe na dighumi na bilime bibedji, mu yuku yowu bamayenemubeghaange nowu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Na mumengu wisuki, bakene ghabughe, Djesu akesyale o Serusaleme. Tumbe tadji na ngudji basamadjabe. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Bamatase yiri tangudji Djesu amabe nowu mu yinombu. Va temu tsisighe, bamabande umurombe va ghari biburu na bambatsi bowu. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Dibila bwena basamamulabe, bakeghabughe o Serusaleme mu uyenemurombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Bilumbu bibedji binovyoghe, ayimuryeru, bamamurasune o ndaghu Nzambi atsane va ghari milonzi mi mighaghe. Amabaghulungu nobawivulaange bivu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Botsu abamamuwulungu bamasutu mu dyele na mu kabusulu tsyandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Ave ngudji na tadji andi bamamulabile, bamasutu, na ngudji amamuwivule rye: «Mwane ami, dibandu yi wutsituvayile nane? Tadji aghu na menu twiwurombi, mbé tumabase na keri.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Akebawake rye: «Dibandu yi dwitombili? Dughédjabi yiri temu djimatole, mu usale bisalu bi Tadji ami?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Tumbe djowu basamawulu adi amarondaange ubatsingule.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Mbana amaghabughe nowu o Nasarete, akebadedilaange. Ngudji andi amakelisaange mambu motsu o ghari murime andi. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Na Djesu amaneghaange, amabe na dyele, na amabe na yese va wusu Nzambi na va wusu batu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma San-Batise</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mrk 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">San 1.19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Mu dighumi na bilime biranu (15), bi durumu du kaghe dji Rome, Tibere, Ponze Pilate akabe yidjeti mu yinange yi Sudé. Yirode djandi wune akebe yidjeti yinange yi Ngalile. Filipe, mwane ngudji andi amabe yidjeti yi binange bi Yiture na Tarkonite, mbana Lisanyase djandi akebe yidjeti mu yinange yi Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Ave Ane na Kayife bamabilaange bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, va temu eni, mbembu Nzambi djimatsingulu San, mwane Sakari o kumu. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Anodjidile, San akenange yinange ayimabe mu mughule mudjambe Sordani, mu yenelubusaange batu rye: «Kalughanu mutsanu na batuswanu. Nzambi odutande mabi menu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Nane direndulu mu dibuku di mubiyitsi Yisayi rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Adidi la dyufi di mutu oyighamuyi o kumu rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Tsonzighanu nzile Fumu na sungighanu manzile mandi.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Bibususu byotsu byubasusu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Mikongu myotsu na bikundubughe byotsu byudyamusu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Manzile amarekeme mosungughu, na amavu bidune moghulene.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Na batu botsu bolabe dughobutsu du Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa 40.3-5</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Yinombu yimawendaange o uyébatusu nandi, akebatsingulaange rye: «Dibure pili nane djenu, anyi amadulubuse urine kabu Nzambi adjiruyi? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Lasanu mitsanu miwelimine amyulase rye dumakalughe dyele. Duyavose mu djenubeni rye: “Tudji baane ba Aberaame.” Ngenze nyidutsinguli bwena ne na mamani memama, Nzambi orungule ufikulile Aberaame baane. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Dyumbi dimatsonzughu mu uwangile mwiri mu nganzi. Kaboghu mwiri wotsu awughéburi milunde miboti wuwangu nobwaghu o mudji.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Yinombu yimamuwivulaange rye: «Yike tsyeni tuvayile?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Akebawaghule rye: «Awu avu na bikutu bibedji akaveghe yimosi oghaane yikutu, na awu avu na bighudji, aghabi wandi.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Babolitsi ba lepu, djowandi bamawendaange o uyébatusu na bamawivule San rye: «Mulonzi, ka djetu yiturunguse uvaghe?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Akebawaghule rye: «Ave dubongilaange lepu, duyavyosulilaange mu adimaduveghu musughu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Baghore wandi bakemuwivule rye: «Fumu, ka djetu, tsyé tuvayile?» Amabatsingule rye: «Duyabongaange mbongu ombu mutu na biwarile, vo na mfurulu, tumbe singenanu na fute tsyenu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Batu botsu bamabe nzunzubaa na yitu! Mutu-mutu amatase rye tangudji San djandi Kirisete. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Mbana San akebatsingule rye: «Menu nyidubatisi mu mambe, tumbe mususu awupyoghulile mangolu orughe. Nga nyiwelimine mu unyangule mikudu mi bapondu bandi. Djandi odubatise na Yinyuni Yisyeme na mudji. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Aghange ngwangu adjivu nane musomu mu dikake dyandi mu ukakesune milunde amiboti na bipupu. Oghukighe milunde amiboti o yisweghulu yandi, tumbe obwaghe bipupu o mudji awughétsimi.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>San amalonzaange batu Musamu wuboti na akebawarisa mu mambu mamosi mapwele. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Vane-vane, San amasyembaange Yirode awu amabe yidjeti mu yinange yi Ngalile mumbari amabonge na akewele Yirodyase mughatsi mwane ngudji andi, dibandu mambu mamosi mabive amamwévaghaange. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Va djulu motsu mane, Yirode amabwese dibi disusu: amakotise San o tsughu.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dubatusu du Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mrk 1.9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Batu botsu bamayibatusungu, na Djesu wandi akerughe mu uyibatusu. Ave amasambililaange, djulu djikedibughe. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Na Yinyuni Yisyeme yimaruyile o djulu mu yibaghunu yi dibembi, yimasundughe mu djandi. Dyufi dimawulunu o djulu novose rye: «Wudji mwane ami murime, mu ndedju, nyimasunze durondu dwami dwotsu.» <figure style="fig" alt="Dubatusu du Djesu" file="WA03810b.tif" size="col" loc="3.21-22" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="3.22"/><verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bukulu bu Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Ave Djesu amabandile yisalu yandi, amabe na maghumi-maryeru (30) ma bilime. Batu bamamulabaange nane, mwane Sosefe obangaange mwane Yili. <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Yili adji mwane Matate. Matate adji mwane Levi. Levi adji mwane Meleki. Meleki adji mwane Sanayi. Sanayi adji mwane Sosefe. Sosefe adji <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>mwane Matatyase. Matatyase adji mwane Amose. Amose adji mwane Nawume. Nawume adji mwane Yiseli. Yiseli adji mwane Naghayi. Naghayi adji <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>mwane Mate. Mate adji mwane Matatyase. Matatyase adji mwane Semeyine. Semeyine adji mwane Sodeke. Sodeke adji mwane Sode. <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Sode adji mwane Sowanane. Sowanane adji mwane Resa. Resa adji mwane Sorobabele. Sorobabele adji mwane Salatyele. Salatyele adji mwane Neri. Neri adji <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>mwane Meleki. Meleki adji mwane Adi. Adi adji mwane Kosame. Kosame adji mwane Lemadame. Lemadame adji mwane Eré. <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Eré adji mwane Djesu. Djesu adji mwane Lyesere. Lyesere adji mwane Sorime. Sorime adji mwane Matate. Matate adji mwane Levi. <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Levi adji mwane Simewu. Simewu adji mwane Suda. Suda adji mwane Sosefe. Sosefe adji mwane Soname. Soname adji mwane Lyakime. <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Lyakime adji mwane Meleya. Meleya adji mwane Mena. Mena adji mwane Matata. Matata adji mwane Natane. Natane adji mwane Davide. <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Davide adji mwane Djese. Djese adji mwane Sobede. Sobede adji mwane Bwase. Bwase adji mwane Sala. Sala adji mwane Nasone. <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nasone adji mwane Aminadabe. Aminadabe adji mwane Adimine. Adimine adji mwane Areni. Areni adji mwane Serome. Serome adji mwane Farese. Farese adji mwane Suda. <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Suda adji mwane Sakobe. Sakobe adji mwane Yisaake. Yisaake adji mwane Aberaame. Aberaame adji mwane Tera. Tera adji mwane Nakore. <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nakore adji mwane Seruke. Seruke adji mwane Raku. Raku adji mwane Faleke. Faleke adji mwane Ebere. Ebere adji mwane Sala. <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Sala adji mwane Kayiname. Kayiname adji mwane Arefaghade. Arefaghade adji mwane Seme. Seme adji mwane Nowe. Nowe adji mwane Lameke. <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lameke adji mwane Matuselame. Matuselame adji mwane Yinoke. Yinoke adji mwane Sarede. Sarede adji mwane Maleleyele. Maleleyele adji mwane Kayiname. <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kayiname adji mwane Enose. Enose adji mwane Sete. Sete adji mwane Adame. Adame adji mwane Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu emangu na Dyabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mrk 1.12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Djesu anoghusughe mudjambe Sordani, amabe abasu na Yinyuni Yisyeme, ayimamubeghe o dukange. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Aghune, Djesu akemangu na Dyabu mu maghumi-mana (40) ma bilumbu. Mu temu eni, asamadji yisalu. Bilumbu byeni binosuke, Djesu akebe na nzale. <verse eid="LUK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Kaboghu, Dyabu akemutsingule rye: «Payi wudji Mwane Nzambi, kaluse dimani dyédidi dipe.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Djesu amamuwaghule: «Bisonu bi Nzambi bivosi rye: “Mutu aghodilaange monyu andi, bu mu dipe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Det 8.3</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Dyabu, akemubeghe o djulu mukongu wuneni. Akemulase bulongu bwotsu bu butambe. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Na Dyabu akemutsingule rye: «Nyuwuveghe bundumbe bwotsu na busine bu malongu meni mame mumbari byotsu bipeghu na nyurungule wuveghe mutu wotsu nane nyirondili. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Kaboghu, payi wukutumine, byotsu bibi byube abyaghu.»<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Mu dyoni, Djesu akemuwaghule: «Bisonu bi Nzambi bivosi rye: “Yike Nzambi Fumu pinze wukutuminaange na djandi pinze wuyitsaange<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Det 6.13</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Dyabu akebwémubeghe o Serusaleme, akemusunze o djulu ndaghu Nzambi. Akemutsingule rye: «Payi wudji Mwane Nzambi, kebwaghe kwange no tsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Bisonu bivose yi: “Nzambi orume byanze byandi mu wughaghaange.” <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Na ebwévose rye: “Byanze byeni byuwuwake va makake mowu mumbari dikulu dyaghu dikeduku mu dimani<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Nim 91.11-12</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Djesu akemughabusile rye: «Bisonu bivosi: “Wuyamange Fumu Nzambi aghu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Det 6.16</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Anomumange mu motsu, Dyabu akekakene nandi tena amamwérombile tonu susu.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebandi yisalu yandi o Ngalile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mrk 1.14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Djesu amaghabughe o Ngalile, na mangolu ma Yinyuni Yisyeme. Na didume dyandi dikenyave mu yinange yotsu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Amenelonzaange mu mandaghu ma tsambu ma baSwife na batu bakenemudumisaange.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esanzu o musyengi wu Nasarete</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mrk 6.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Djesu amawende o Nasarete awu djandi amabanguyile. Mu yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife, Djesu, mu yuku yandi amakote o ndaghu owu dusambu. Amareleme mu urange Bisonu bi Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Bakemuveghe Dibuku di Bisonu bi mubiyitsi Yisayi. Akedidibule na akelabe yibuku ayimabe yirendu:<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>«Yinyuni yi Fumu yidji mu menu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">yimambyatse mu ughabe musamu wuboti ombu bidjaghe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Amanzindighe muyebeluse abango manyoni mu mirime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">mu yésamune dudjeghusu ombu bise tsughu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">mu ubeluse bidunge na mu udjeyise djowu abekwanu.<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Mu uyisamune yilime yi yese ayi Fumu amaveghe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa 61.1-2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Va djulu vane, Djesu anomane urange, akedibighe dibuku dyeni, akedighabusile musalitsi na aketsane. Botsu abamabe o ghari ndaghu eni dusambu dji baSwife bakemutsunaange yiswisu. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Na akebande ubatsingule rye: «Na muni, mambu ma Bisonu byébibi mamadughusu nane dutsiwululu.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Mu dyoni, botsu bakemusingisile bumbedji na bakesutu mu mambu ma yese ame djandi amavosaange. Batu beni, bakevosaange rye: «Awuwu tsi mwane Sosefe?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Djesu akebawake rye: «Tangudji dumbukile nongu adjivosi bwena, “Mubuyitsi, tsyékebughe ndebeni.” Ta dubwévose: “Tumawulu motsu ame wumavaghe o Kapernawume, tsyémavayi vave o bulongu bwaghu.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Yike Djesu akebwébatsingule rye: «Nyidutsinguli dingenze, mubiyitsi aghérondu o bulongu bwandi. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Dingenze nyurunguse udutsingule yiri vamabe bakwili bapwele o Yisrayele va temu Eli ave mvule djimasikimine mu bilime biryeru na ngondi yisyamunu na ave dungosu dumabile mu bulongu bwotsu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">Ka1 17.1</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Ne vane Nzambi asamasindighe Eli ombu bakwili botsu, tumbe ombu wumosi awumatsanaange o Sarepete mu bulongu bu Sidone<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">Ka1 17.8-16</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Wubangaange wandi pwele bibedu bi nyámbi o Yisrayele va temu mubiyitsi Elise. Ne nane botsu basamabelughe yike vane Namane mwise Siri<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">Ka2 5.1-14</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Botsu abamabe o ghari ndaghu eni dusambu dji baSwife bakebase na kabu ave bamawululu mambu meni. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Batu beni bakereleme bakenemusindilaange vale na musyengi na bakemubeghe va djulu mukongu ave Nasarete amabe arungulu, muyémusindile o mbengi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Tumbe Djesu akevyoghe va ghari owu na akenewende.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutu awikambusu na yinyuni yibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mrk 1.21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Djesu amasundughe o Kapernawume musyengi Ngalile, na akelonzaange mu yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Batu bakebembu na ndonzulu andi, mumbari amavosaange na durumu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Vamabe o ghari ndaghu dusambu dji baSwife dibaale dimabe na yinyuni yibive va ghari owu. Yinyuni yikeghamughe na mangolu: <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>«Aa! Djesu mwise Nasarete, yi witurombi, utsirughe oyitubunge nyidjabi anyi wuvu, Yibyatsu ayimasindughu na Nzambi!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Djesu akenyangile yinyuni yeni yibi: «Vole na pale mu mutu ewune!» Yinyuni yike bete dibaale dyeni vatsi va ghari mughungi na yikepale, yisamamuvaghe bwali. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Batu botsu bakeghangu na ghome na bakevosaange va ghari owu rye: «Posulu adjidji yi! Erumi binyuni bibive na musughe na mangolu na bipali?» <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Na didume di Djesu dikenyave mu yinange yotsu yi Ngalile.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebelusi pwele bibedu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mrk 1.29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Djesu anoghusughe o ndaghu dusambu dji baSwife, akewende o ndaghu Simu. Bodji bu Simu abu mughetu amabe na dibaghu dineni, na batu abamabe vane, baketatile Djesu akemubeluse. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Djesu akebandeme akebembe bodji bu Simu, akerume dibaghu mu usaghughe, na dibaghu dikesaghughe. Na vane-vane mughetu eni akesimbughe akebande ubasalile mu ubaveghe bighudji.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Wisi unovindeme, botsu abamabangaange na bibedu bi minongu na minongu bakebabeghe ombu Djesu, na akesakighaange mutu-mutu makake na akeyenebabelusaange. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Binyuni bibi wandi bikenepalaange ombu pwele bibedu noyeneghamughe bwena: «Ndedju wudji mwane Nzambi!» Tumbe Djesu akebarume na bukani na amabaghandisaange uvose, mumbari binyuni byeni bimamudjabaange bwena djandi la Kirisete.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esamuni o Sudé</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mrk 1.35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Na wisi witebuyi, Djesu akeghusughe musyengi eni na akewende ave mbure adjikakunu na batu. Yinombu yi batu yikenemurombaange, banomulabe, bamaronde umusikighe nobuse yiri Djesu akékakughe nowu. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Tumbe Djesu akebawake rye: «Nyuyésamune Musamu Wuboti wu Bukaghe bu Nzambi o misyengi mimosi wandi, mumbari adine, Nzambi amanzindiyile.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Mbana, akewenda mu uyenesamunaange mu mandaghu ma tsambu ma baSwife wune bulongu bweni bu Sudé.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yimaghe yulobe na badukitsi bateghe ba Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mrk 1.16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Yilumbu, Djesu amabe va mughule yilibe yi Senesarete. Yinombu yimaghukume mu uwulu mbembu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Akelabe matu mabedji va disabu na balobitsi bamasusaange masinge mowu. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Anolabe bwena ake va mbake batu, akemate mu bwatu bumosi, abumabe bu Simu, na akemuwivule mu kwekise bwatu mwa vale na disimu. Djesu aketsane mu bwatu na akebande ulonze yinombu yeni musamu andi.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Anomane ulonze, aketsingule Simu: «Kwekise bwatu bwaghu o yitsibe, ndedju na bambatsi baghu, tsyébwaghyanu bambuse benu mu uwabe.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simu akemuwake rye: «Fumu, tutsiwélighe wuwabe mukolu wotsu, tughadile nesi yughoke. Tumbe ave wumanzingule nane, yike masinge ngabwaghe mu mambe.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Yike, bakebwaghe masinge mowu mu mambe, bakeghaange banyame bapwele na mune masinge meni, vengu wupasighe. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Bavubitsi beni, bakeghebule bambatsi bowu, abamabe mu bwatu bususu bakibawamuse. Bambatsi beni, banorughe, bakebase matu motsu mabedji na bayame, mamabe beli nodyame. <figure style="fig" alt="Yimaghe yulobe" file="WA03818b.tif" size="col" loc="5.1-8" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="5.7"/> <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simu Pyere anolabe yimaghe nane yine, akighudume va wusu Djesu na akemutsingule rye: «Wusughe va wusu ami, Fumu, mumbari nyidji mutu mabi!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Simu, na botsu abamabe nandi, bakeghangu djobotsu na keri, dibandu pwele banyame abe bamaghaange. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Keri eni, djimabe wandi mu bambatsi ba Simu, Sake na San, baane ba Sebede. Djesu aketsingule Simu rye: «Uyabe na keri mumbari ubongile na nyangu, wube yike mulobitsi batu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Simu na bambatsi bandi bakeghabuse matu mowu o disimu, bakesile byowu byotsu na bakeduke Djesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebelusi yibedu yi nyámbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mrk 1.40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Djesu anobe o musyengi mosi, wukurughe dibaale dimabelaange nyámbi. Anomulabe, akighudume va wusu andi, mbami va butambe na akemulembiyile novose rye: «Fumu payi wirondi, ndyomisi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Djesu akesambe dikake akemubembe na akevose rye: «Nyirondi, tsyélyomi.» Na vane-vane, nyámbi djikemughusughe. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yike, Djesu akemughandise rye: «Wuyaditsingule mutu. Tumbe wende yékelase ombu yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, mbana vaghule paghu dulyomusu adji Moyise amarume mu ulase botsu rye wumabelughe.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Didume di Djesu dike bwelaange wunyave. Binombu bi batu bike wukemaange na bakebelusungu mu mali mowu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Tumbe Djesu, amabangaange na yufu yukakenaange na batu, mu uyésambilaange pinze.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebelusi yimbolutu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mrk 2.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Yilumbu Djesu amalonzaange batu. BaFarisi na milonzi mi mighaghe bamabe batsane vane. Djowu abamarughusenaange mu mimbu motsu ma Ngalile na ma Sudé no musyengi Serusaleme. Mangolu ma Fumu Nzambi mamabe mu Djesu mu ubelusaange bibedu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Va marughe babaale, banangule yimbolutu mu dusyengi, bamarondaange umusunze va wusu Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Tumbe basamadile dikotulu, mumbari yinombu yimabe yineni tena va mune ndaghu. Bakemate o djulu mwanze ndaghu, bakedibule dilute na bakemusunduse mu dusyengi va misu mowu, va wusu Djesu.<figure style="fig" alt="Djesu ebelusi yimbolutu" file="WA03824b.tif" size="col" loc="5.17-26" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="5.19"/> <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Djesu anolabe yitu yowu, akevose na yimbolutu rye: «Mbatsi ami, mabi maghu mamatandu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Yike baFarisi na milonzi mi mighaghe bakengungurunaange mu mirime myowu: «Mutu awuwu ni oyilenzi Nzambi, anyi orungule utande mabi, patsi Nzambi pinze?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Djesu anodjabe matase mowu, akevose rye: «Yi dubile na matase mabive nane mane? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Dike divure mu uvose rye: “Mabi maghu mamatandu” vo uvose rye: “Releme yenewende”? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Mumbari dukedjabe yiri Mwane Mutu ane musughe utande mabi ma batu vave butambe.» Mbana akevose na yimbolutu rye: «Nyighutsinguli, releme, bonge dusyengi dwaghu we o ndaghu aghu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Vane-vane amareleme va wusu mughungi, nobonge dusyengi dwandi nowende o ndaghu andi, akenedodisaange Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Mughungi wotsu wuke kambulu, na wukenedodisaange Nzambi novose rye: «Na muni tumalabe mambu maboti ma muvingu!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu enengili Levi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mrk 2.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Va djulu motsu mane, Djesu akepale, akelabe mubolitsi lepu dine dyandi Levi atsane va tavule bisalu. Djesu akemutsingule rye: «Nduki!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Levi akereleme, akesile byotsu nomuduke. <verse eid="LUK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Na vane, Levi akemuvayile mulambu o ndaghu andi. Yinombu yi babolitsi ba lepu na batu bamosi wandi bamabe nowu va tavule mu udji va mosi. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Va ghari owu, baFarisi na milonzi mi mighaghe bakeneningaange na bakewivule badukitsi ba Djesu rye: «Dibandu yi dwilili nonu na babolitsi ba lepu na bavayitsi ba mabi?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Bango polu, baghaane nzale mubuyitsi, tumbe djowu abebeli. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Kaboghu, menu, ngarughe mu djowu bana abekelabe yiri basungeme, tumbe dibandu djowu bana abevayi mabi bakekaluse mitsanu myowu.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu na duwaru du pwile na nzale</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mrk 2.18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>BaFarisi baketsingule Djesu rye: «Badukitsi ba San na betu, bewarili nzale na besambili; abaghu, udjibédji nonu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Djesu akebawake rye: «Djenu, durunguse wuwimine bambatsi ba yiwetsi bighudji ne nane akivu nowu? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Tumbe vorughe yilumbu ayi mulumi obarambusulu; mbana avane, borunguse wuwarile nzale na pwile.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Djesu akebwébabukile nongu eni djidji: «Wughaa mutu wipasi yirendi mu yikutu ayighone nolonde ayiwulu. Yike evayi nane, yirendi ayighone mbé yighosoghene mu yikutu ayighulu na yikutu yeni yupasighe. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Wughaa mutu wandi orunguse uwitile malamu maghone mu batsuve aba ghulu. Kaboghu, malamu meni maghone mbé morubise batsuve, na makepumughe. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Vengu owitile malamu amaghone mu batsuve abaghone! <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Na wughaa mutu mosi wandi omanu malamu amaghulu akeronde wunu amaghone, na yikevayi nane, ovose rye: “Amaghulu mamavyoghe amaghone.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Mwane Mutu, Fumu yilumbu yuvume</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mrk 2.23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Mu yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife, Djesu akenevyoghaange na badukitsi bandi mu manungi ma putu mu utole o mimbu mamosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">manungi ma putu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">abinengulu «blé», munongu bivaru bivu nane putu abi baSwife bamanighaange milunde m bumbighe mape mowu.</char></note>. Badukitsi beni, bakenedokulaange putu. Bakenetsisotulaange na bakeyenejangaange. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Mwa dighuki di baFarisi bakebawivule rye: «Dibandu yi dwivayili mambu amaghandusu “kilikingi” yilumbu yuvume?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Ayi, dusamaraange mu bisonu bi Nzambi, adi Davide na batu bandi bamavaghe ave bamawululu nzale? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Davide amakote o ndaghu paghu, akebonge mape amavaghululu Nzambi. Akedji na akemaveghe botsu abamabe nandi. Nenane, yike bu bavaghulitsi ba paghu pinze abamaveghu musughe mu umadji.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Djesu akebwétsingule baFarisi rye: «Mwane Mutu djandi, la Fumu yilumbu yuvume.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebelusi dibaale adivu na bubomfi mu wowu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mrk 3.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Yilumbu yisusu yuvume yi baSwife, Djesu akekote o ndaghu dusambu mu ulonze. O ghari ndaghu eni, wumabe dibaale dimabe na bubomfi mu dikake di mabaale. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Milonzi mi mighaghe na baFarisi bamarombaange dyele dyufwengilile Djesu. Kaboghu bamamuketanga mu ulabe yeri obeluse mutu mu yilumbu yuvume. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Tumbe Djesu, anodjabe matase mowu, aketsingule yibomfi yeni yi dikake rye: «Releme, rughe va wusu botsu!» Akereleme, akerughe. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Djesu, akewivule milonzi mi mighaghe na baFarisi yeri: «Diwelimine mu mighaghe myenu mu vaghe diboti vo dibi yilumbu yuvume, wughobule monyu mutu vo ughusile wubungene?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Anobaghengise djowu botsu, aketsingule yibomfi yeni rye: «Simbule dikake dyaghu.» Akedisimbule, na dikake dyandi dikebelughe. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Tumbe, milonzi mi mighaghe na baFarisi bakebase na kabu neni, bakewivusunaange rye: «Tsyeni tukedilile Djesu?»<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esoli dighumi na bilumbi bibedji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mrk 3.13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Mune temu eni, Djesu amamate o djulu mukongu mu uyésambile. Na akevyose mukolu wotsu mu usambilaange Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Na wisi etebuyi, Djesu akenengile badukitsi bandi va mughule andi, akesole va ghari owu dighumi na babedji (12) mu ubalughe Bilumbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Djowu bamabe: Simu awu Djesu amalughe Pyere, Andere ngebi andi, Sake na San, Filipe na Batelemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Mati, Tome, Sake mwane Alefé, Simu mungo nyongi bulongu bwandi, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Sudase mwane Sake na Sudase Yikalyote awu amasumbise Djesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu elonzi mughungi na ebelusi bibedu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Djesu, anosundughe mukongu na bilumbi byandi, akesikeme va yidesi ave vamabe badukitsi bandi. Yinombu yineni yi batu yimarughesenaange o yinange yi Sudé, o musyengi Serusaleme, na mu misyengi mi Tire na Sidone amimabe mu mughule mubu. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Botsu, bamarughaange mu uyiwulu Djesu na mu uyidile dubelusu. Akedjeyisaange bamosi wandi abamatsoghusungu na binyuni bibive. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Yinombu yotsu yimarondaange umubembe, mumbari mangolu mamapalaange mu djandi mamababelusaange.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maboti na maghughe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Djesu, anoghengise badukitsi bandi, akevose rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Ubwedji ombu djenu aduvu bidjaghe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">mumbari Bukaghe bu Nzambi buke bwenu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Ubwedji ombu djenu aduvu na nzale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">mumbari dughukuru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Ubwedji ombu djenu abedwilili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">mumbari dureke.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Ubwedji ombu djenu abedwivinu na batu, abedwiwengulu, abedwisyengu, abedwisanzu novosulu mambu mabi, dibandu Mwane Mutu. <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Mu temu eni, saghanu na yinanu na nzangu, mumbari fute neni djidukelisi o djulu. Anane bakaaghe bowu bamakambisilaange babiyitsi va temu owu.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Kamune maghughe ma ombu djenu bisine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">mumbari dumadile menu maboti.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Maghughe ombu djenu adumaghukuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">mumbari dube na nzale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Maghughe ombu djenu adwireki na muni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">mumbari dube mu dikwili na dulile!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Maghughe ombu djenu ave batu botsu bodusingisilaange, mumbari anane bakaaghe bowu bamayitsilaange babiyitsi ba mfurulu!»<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wuronde bambeni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«Tumbe djenu adwikulu nyidutsinguli: Rondanu bambeni benu. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Veghanu myule ombu djowu abeduloyi; na sambilanu mu djowu abedukwani. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Payi mutu atsighudimbe mbate mu dibange adi maghetu, muliyili adi mabaale. Payi mutu erondi ubonge yidjungi yaghu, wuyamughandise ubonge yikutu wandi. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Ghabile botsu abeghuvondi, na payi mutu atsiwubonge yisalu, wuyamusuyighe. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Vaghanu bambatsi mambu ame dwirondi bakeduvayile. <verse eid="LUK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>Payi dwirondi yike abedurondi, kabusulu yi dwikelisi? Ne bavayitsi ba mabi wandi berondi yike abebarondi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Payi dwivayi diboti yike ombu djowu abeduvayi maboti, kabusulu yi dudile? Ne bavayitsi ba mabi wandi bevayi munongu mosi. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Payi dwisombisi buke djowu aborunguse uduvanine, kabusulu yi dudile ombu owu? Ne bango mabi wandi besombisini, na bevaneseni munongu mosi. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Tumbe, rondanu bambeni benu na bavayanu diboti, sombisanu abaghaane yime nenane baghorunguse wudughabusile. Fute enu djube djineni na dube baane ba Nzambi-Pungu, mumbari djabeni aboti ombu bango ninge na ombu mimbini. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Banu na yingebe, nane Tadji enu abile na yingebe.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Duyasosisaange batu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>«Duyasosise na baghodusosise; duyaveghe mbele, na baghoduveghe mbele. Batandyanu, na dutandu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Veghanu na boduveghe: bowitile yetsu yiwelimine mu yevi yenu. Yubatughu noghomu tena yuborumughe. Yetsu ayidumaghabile ayine Nzambi odughabile.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Djesu akebaveghe nongu: «Yidunge akebeghe yidunge nandi? Nesi, boyetsudeme djowu botsu o yidune! <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Mudukitsi aghovyoghulile Fumu andi, tumbe awu alongu burange, obaghunu na Fumu andi. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Dibandu yi wilabili yike yiriri mu disu di mbatsi aghu, mba wughélabi dikutu adivu o dyaghu disu? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Vo tsyeni wutsingulile mwane ngudji: “Mwane ngudji, rughe tuwusuli yiriri ayivu o ghari disu dyaghu”, ndedju awughélabi dikutu adivu o ghari dyaghu disu? Pende nane nde, lérele ughusule dikutu adivu o ghari disu dyaghu, avane ulabe nane wurambusile yiriri ayivu o ghari disu di mwane ngudji.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwiri na milunde myandi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>«Mwiri wuboti wurunguse ubure milunde mibive? Nesi, wughorunguse ubure milunde mibive. Dedi mosi na mwiri wubive wughorunguse ubure milunde miboti. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Kaboghu, kale mwiri widjabunu mu milunde myandi. Baghédoki tundu mu misumbi, mbanane baghédoki, tsafu wandi mu yifundi. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Mutu awuboti, epalisi mambu maboti mu ubwedji wu murimandi. Mutu mubi, epalisi mambu mabi mu wubive wu murime andi. Mumbari mu dufunusu du matase ma murime, munu evosili.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yinonongu yi ndaghu bedji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>«Dibandu yi dwindengilili “Fumu, Fumu!” Mbana dughevayi motsu ame nyidutsinguli? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Kaboghu, wotsu oyinduki, ewulu mambu mami na emadedili, nyudulase nani abaghunu. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Adji nane mutu, amarunge ndaghu andi, aketime pwele ne mu dughunge. Nidu djinorughe, mupupile wukeghubene mu ndaghu eni, na djisamakunge mumbari djimarungu burange. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Tumbe, djandi wune oyiwulu mambu mami na aghemadedili, adji nane mutu awirungi ndaghu va yisyeyi. Ave nyidu djiruyili, mupupile wighubeni mu ndaghu eni na djiberuyi tinde djotsu.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebelusi musalitsi wu yivunde yi baghore</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Ave Djesu amamani wuvosile motsu mane ombu mughungi, akekote o musyengi Kapernawume. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Vane, vamabe yivunde yi baghore ayimabe na musatsi andi awu amarondaange pwele. Amabe na ubele wuneni beli nofu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Anowulu beranguni Djesu, yivunde yeni akesindighe mwa dikabu di bivunde bi baSwife uyémulende mu uyibeluse musatsi andi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>BaSwife beni banotole ombu Djesu, bakemutatile yiri: «Diwelimine wukemuvayile adi djandi evondi. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Ngenze erondi mukute etu, mumbari djandi amarunge ndaghu etu dusambu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Djesu amawende na batu beni. Banobe bebeli na ndaghu, yivunde yeni akesindighe bambatsi bandi mu uyémutsingule rye: «Fumu, wuyaketsoyise mu utole, mumbari nga nyiwelimine yiri wukekote o ndaghu ami. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ladibandu, ngaruyile mebeni ombu waghu. Tumbe tubule yike yighume yimosi na musatsi ami obelughe. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Mewandi, nyidji otsi durumu du bivunde byami, na mewandi nyirumi baghore abendedili. Payi nyurume wumosi: “Wende!” Akewende. Payi nyunengile wune: “Rughe!” Akerughe. Payi nyurume musatsi ami, yiri “Vaghe yeyi!” Akeyivaghe.»<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Ave Djesu amawululu ame yivunde yi baghore amavose, akemusingisile, akeghelughe ombu yinombu ayimayenemudukaange. Akevose rye: «Nyidutsinguli: ne o bulongu bu Yisrayele, nyikalabaange yitu yineni nane.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Bambatsi ba yivunde yeni, ave bamaghabuyile ombu wandi, bakerasune musatsi eni amabelughe.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu erambusi mwane dibaale o musyengi wu Nayine</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:49-56">Luk 8.49-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:11-12">San 11.11-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Yilumbu ayimaduke, Djesu akewende o musyengi wu Nayine. Badukitsi bandi na yinombu yineni bakenewendaange nandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Banotole va dikotulu di musyengi eni, bakebengunu na batu bamawendaange oyetswighe mvumbi, mwane divingu wu mukwili. Yinombu yineni yi musyengi eni yimabe nandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Fumu, anolabe mukwili eni, akebase na yingebe novose rye: «Wuyalile.» <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Anobambene, akebembe yighare. Abamabe bayitsyete, bakesikeme. Akevose: «Mwane dibaale nyiwurumi, releme!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Mwane awumabe wufu, akereleme, aketsane nobande uvose. Djesu akemughabusile ngudji andi. <verse eid="LUK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Botsu bamaghangu na keri. Bakeyitsaange Nzambi novose rye: «Ka mune mubiyitsi wuneni wukuvu va ghari etu! Nzambi amayilingule mukute andi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Didume di Djesu dikenyave mu Sudé djotsu kwange na mu mighule.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Badukitsi abe San-Batise amasindighe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-11">Mat 11.2-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>San-Batise anowulu motsu ame badukitsi bandi bamavose, akenengile babedji va ghari owu. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Akebasindighe ombu Fumu mu yemuwivule rye: «Ndedju la Yisolu yi Nzambi etutindili vo tukelise mususu?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Na betoli ombu Djesu, bakevose: «San-Batise atsitutinde ombu awu mu uwivule rye: “Ndedju awu Nzambi etutindili vo tukelise mutu ususu?”» <verse eid="LUK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Banotole, bakerasune Djesu ebelusi pwele bibedu, bibomfi na abamabe na binyuni bibi na utyemuse bidunge. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Akebawaghule bwena, wendanu, yétsingulanu San amedumalabe, amedumawulu: «Bidunge bimalabe, bitsyoku bimasungeme mwendu, bango nyámbi bamalyomusu, abamabe madibe bamawulu, abamabe bafu bamarambughe na musamu wuboti wumasamunu ombu bidjaghe. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Ubwedji ombu djandi awu aghotsyemuse yitu yandi na aghodile tonu djuberuyile dibandu menu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu evayi bumbedji mu San</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Abamatindu na San banoghabughe, Djesu akevose na yinombu ayimabe vane mu dyambu di San rye: «Yi dumelabe o dukange? Dundubi dwipupusu na mupunge? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Yi dumayelabe? Mutu adware bikutu bi bandumbe? Nesi! Mumbari batu abedwari bikutu bi bandumbe na abavu na maboti mapwele, djowu betsani mu mandaghu ma bakaghe. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Yike yi, dumayelabe? Mubiyitsi? Nine nyidutsinguli avyoghulile ne mubiyitsi! <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Dingenze, Bisonu bi Nzambi bivosi mu dyambu di San rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“Lanu, nyutinde yilumbi yami va wusu aghu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">mu uwutsonziyile nzile<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Mbana Djesu akemwébwele ubatsingule: «Bwé dingenze nyidutsinguli, vasekaburu mutu awuvyoghulile San. Tumbe, awu agheyi mu Bukaghe bu Nzambi, amuvyoghe buneni. <verse eid="LUK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Batu botsu, ne babolitsi ba lepu abamamuwulu, bamasingisile Nzambi yiri asungeme na Fumu erondi ubaghobule na bakesinge ubatusu na San. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Tumbe baFarisi na milonzi mi mighaghe bakebuse durondu du Nzambi mu djowu na bakebuse ubatusu na San.»<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Djesu akebwévose: «Na anyi nyurungule ubaghusunu batu ba temu adjidji? Nane yi bavu? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Ba baghunu na baane abaghukume va mulebi, betsingusini rye: “Tumadusiyile milombu, dusamayine. Tumaduwimbilile nimbu tsi manyoni, dusamalile.” <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Ave San-Batise amaruyile, asamadjangaange bighudji nonu malamu, dumavose rye: “Ane Yinyuni yibive.” <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Mwane Mutu amarughe, edji nenu na dwivosi yiri Kamune mulitsi na munwitsi wu, djandi mbatsi babolitsi ba lepu na bavayitsi ba mabi. <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Tumbe botsu abegharu dyele di Nzambi, besingi yiri djandi evayi diboti.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mughetu wu mabi etandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mrk 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">San 12.1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Mufarisi wumosi amalende Djesu mu uyédji nandi. Djesu amakote o ndaghu andi na amavyoghe va metse. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Vane, vakerughe mughetu yimbembu. Anodjabe yiri Djesu amayedji o ndaghu muFarisi, akebarasune na muyombu wubase mu yirure yi dighe. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Mughetu eni anokote, akereleme o nzime Djesu nolile. Anobotse matambi mandi na matsange, akematsindulaange na nange tsyandi. Akemafife nowitile muyombu. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Mufarisi eni awu amamunengile, anolabe nane, akengungurunaange o murime: «Mbeyi dibaale dyeni didi adji mubiyitsi awungenze, mbé atsidjabe munongu mughetu awutsimubembe nane avu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Djesu akenangule dyufi nomunengile: «Simu, nyine mwa dyambu dyughutsingule.» Simu kamuwaghule rye: «Mulonzi, vose.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Na Djesu akevose rye: «Babaale babedji bamanwanaange mutu mbongu. Wumosi amanwanaange kame-yiranu tsi badoli, awune maghumi-maranu (50)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Wumosi amanwanaange kame-yiranu tsi badoli, awune maghumi-maranu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu temu eni djine, awuteghe amadile fute dji maghumi mabedji ma miweli. Awu mubedji, fute dji miweli mibedji. </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Anolabe bwé baghorungule wumuvanine, akebasile mughanu wotsu na akebatande. Anyi omuronde pwele mu mubedji ewune?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simu akewaghule rye: «Nyitasi, djandi awu amabe na mughanu wuneni amatandu.» Djesu akemutsingule rye: «Wune ndunge.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Djesu anoghelughe ombu mughetu, akevose na Simu rye: «Wilabi mughetu ewuwu? Ave nyitsikotile o ndaghu aghu, wughapeghe mambe mosuse matambi. Tumbe djandi, amamabotse na matsange mandi, mbanane, amamatsindule na nange tsyandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Ndedju wughambumbe. Tumbe djandi nyikotilaange, aghedundi ufife matambi mami. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Ndedju wughakwitile matsi va djulu muru ami. Tumbe djandi atsikobise nowitile muyombu mu matambi mami. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Ladibandu, nyighutsinguli bwena ne mabi mandi motsu mamamutandu, mumbari yirondu yandi yineni. Tumbe awubetandi mwa pesu, yirondu yandi yidji pesu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Mbanane Djesu amavose na mughetu eni: «Mabi maghu mamatandu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Abamadjangaange va mosi nandi, bamavosaange va ghari owu: «Awuwu ni oyitandi ne mabi?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Tumbe Djesu akevose na mughetu: «Yitu yaghu yimaghughobule, wendange mu duvotsu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Baghetu abamenedukaange Djesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Va djulu vane, Djesu amanangaange misyengi na mimbu mu uyenesamune Musamu Wuboti wu Bukaghe bu Nzambi. Dighumi na badukitsi bandi babedji (12) bamabe nandi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>na mwa dikabu di baghetu abe Djesu amasanze binyuni bibi nobeluse mali diwendili yiri: Mari mwise Maghedale awu amasanzu yisambwali yi binyuni bibi, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Sane, mughatsi Kuse mukelitsi maboti ma Yirode, Sisane na bamosi abamaveghaange maboti mowu mu uwamuse Djesu na badukitsi bandi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu Mukukitsi tsangu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mrk 4.1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Yinombu yimarughaange yari na yari mu misyengi mu uyibengune na Djesu. Na mughungi wighukimi, akebabwayile nongu édjidji: <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Mukukitsi amapale nowende o nungi andi muyékuke tsangu. Ave amakukilaange, mwa dikabu dikebondughe mu nzile. Batu bakeditsyarile na batsoli abamarughusenaange o djulu bakidode. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Dikabu dimosi, dikebondughe va yilale yi mamani. Tsangu tsyeni, tsinobende, tsikeneghe pesu na tsikenengene dibandu dighambu di posi mambe. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Dikabu adine, dikebondughe va ghari matsyendi. Dikebende va mosi na matsyendi. Matsyendi meni maketsitutse. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Tumbe dikabu adimasyale, dikebondughe va butambe buboti. Tsangu djikebende na kadi yivaru yikebure kame milunde.» Na Djesu yikemani uvose nane, akebwese unangule dyufi rye: «Wulwanu, wotsu avu na matudji limbe mu uwulu, awulu!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dibandu yi, Djesu evosili na banongu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mrk 4.10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Mu dyoni badukitsi bandi, bakemuwivule divindughulu di nongu eni. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Akebawake rye: «Dumaveghu yese yudjabe bikeke bi Bukaghe bu Nzambi, tumbe ombu bane, mambu meni, me batsingulu mu banongu mumbari:</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 8:10">“Ne batsighengile, bagholabe;</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 8:10">ne batsiwulu, baghotsiyise<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6.9</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu evindiyi nongu dji mukukitsi tsangu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mrk 4.13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>«Lanu divindughulu di nongu eni: tsangu, mbembu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Tsangu atsimabondughe mu nzile, djowu abewulu mbembu Nzambi. Tumbe Dyabu eyiwusule musamu eni mu mirime myowu, mumbari bakewusinge na bakeghobulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Tsangu atsimabondughe mu mamani, djowu bane, payi bamawulu musamu, bakewuwake na nzangu. Tumbe mwa pesu temu, baghewughangisi nowutsanise mu mirime myowu. Ave dumangu dwiruyili, bakedunde yitu. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Tsangu atsimabondughe va ghari matsyendi, djowu bane, abewulu mbembu Nzambi bedjighangisi na baghedjidedili dibandu munyongu, maboti na nzale tsi musoni. Na mutsanu owu wiburi milunde, tumbe migheweeli. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Tsangu atsimabondughe mu butambe abu boti, djowu bane abewulu mbembu Nzambi na murime wusunde, bédjighangisi na yikanane na mutsanu owu wiburi milunde amiweeli.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yinonongu yi dyénini di lambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mrk 4.21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>«Vagha mutu ebanzi lambi na edjisunzi otsi ponzi vo otsi tangi, tumbe mbé odjisunze va djulu dingase mumbari djikemonitse botsu abekoti o ghari ndaghu. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Yime yotsu ayivu yikeke yudjabunu yilumbu; ayimusweghe, yubawulu va yimwani “velee”. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Kebenanu mu kulusu enu, mumbari, wotsu avu na yime, bomubwese. Tumbe, djandi wune awu aghaane yisalu, opatulu ne mwa pesu adjivu nandi.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngudji na baane ba ngudji ba Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mrk 3.31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Ngudji na baane ba ngudji ba Djesu, bamaronde umulabe. Banotole ave amabe, basamarunguse ubambene nandi dibandu yinombu yeni. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Baketsingule Djesu rye: «Ngudji na baane ba ngudji aghu djowu bane bavu o dulombili na bérondi uwulabe.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Tumbe Djesu akebatsingule djobotsu rye: «Ngudji na baane ba ngudji ami, djowu abewulu na bédedili mbembu Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esiyiyi mungudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mrk 4.35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Mwa yilumbu, Djesu anonangeme mu bwatu na badukitsi bandi, akebatsingule rye: «Twendyanu o disimu dine di yilibe.» Na bakewende. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Ave bamawendilaange, Djesu akewende yilu. Sundile mupunge wuneni wukeghumbe mu yilibe, bwatu bukebande wubase na mambe, na bakabe mu purulu.<figure style="fig" alt="Djesu esiyiyi mungudi" file="WA03850b.tif" size="col" loc="5.22-25" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="8.23"/> <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Dinobe nane, badukitsi bakebambene va mughule Djesu, bakemusimbule noghamughe rye: «Fumu, Fumu, yike ufu, tukefu!» Djesu anosimbughe, akenyangile mupunge na mibidji, bikesigheme. Na musighe wuneni wukabe «swii». <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Djesu aketsingule badukitsi bandi rye: «Yitu yenu yika?» Mu ghome adjimabe nowu, bakesutu na bakevosaange va ghari owu rye: «Mutu awuwu nyi wirumi ne mupunge na mambe na vane bimudedili!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esanzi binyuni bibi mu dibaale o musyengi Seraseni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mrk 5.1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Djesu na badukitsi bandi bamatsyekeme o bulongu bu baSeraseni o disimu dine di yilibe adisungesene na Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Ave Djesu amasunduyile vatsi, dibaale di musyengi eni, adimabe na binyuni bibi dikeyémubengusene. Vane kale asamamwédwaraange bikutu, amasileminaange mu dulombili, mu mambine. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Anolabe Djesu, amaghamughe, amakebwaghe va makulu mandi na akevose o djulu rye: «Dyambu yi witombi, Djesu, Mwane Nzambi adjitinde djulu? Kokolu, nyighulendi, wuyanzoyise!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Mbana Djesu akerume binyuni bibive abimamukambisaange yi lenganu nopale. BaSeraseni, bamamutungaange myowu na makulu na bapange na mu bivangu bi madilu mu umukelise. Tumbe, akebitabulaange. Binyuni byeni bibi bimenemubeghaange mu mbure atsi amabilaange pinze o ghari dukange. <verse eid="LUK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Djesu akemuwivule: «Dine dyaghu yi?» Akemuwaghule: «Yinombu». Amawaghule nane, mumbari bamabe binyuni bipwele. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Na bikelende Djesu, akébitinde o Mbengi.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Vane, vamabe mughambe wuneni wu bangulu awumadjangaange o djulu mukongu. Binyuni byeni bikelende Djesu yiri bikekote mu bangulu. Na Djesu akebaveghe musughe. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Binyuni bibi bikepale mu mutu eni, bikekote mu bangulu. Mughambe eni wukevindeme mukongu mbangu, wukeputume mu yilibe «mfughuu», wukevevughe. <verse eid="LUK 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Abamakelisaange bangulu beni, banolabe nane, bamarine na bamenenyavise tsangu mu musyengi na mu masaku. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Batu bamawende muyélabe adimavyoghe. Banotole ombu Djesu, bakerasune dibaale adimapalusu binyuni atsane va wusu andi, adware, asigheme na akepolu. Na batu beni bakeghangu na ghome. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Abobamalabe yimaghe yeni, bakeyetsingule nane Djesu amabelusile dibaale dyeni.<verse eid="LUK 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Bise Seraseni botsu, bakelende Djesu yiri arambuyi ombu wowu, mumbari bamaghangu na ghome adji neni. Djesu akenangeme mu bwatu noghabusile. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Djandi awu amapalusu binyuni bibi, akelende Djesu akenewendaange nandi. Tumbe Djesu akemughabuse o ndaghu andi nomurume: <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>«Yenetsingule batu baghu botsu ame Nzambi amawuvayile.» Mu dyoni, amayenewende noyenevaghaange bumbedji mu motsu ame Djesu amamuvayile.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu erambusi mwane Sayirise nobeluse mughetu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mrk 5.21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Ave Djesu amaghabuyile o disimu dine di yilibe, yinombu yimamukelisaange mu umusangile. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Na vakerughe dibaale, dine dyandi Sayirise amabe yivunde yi ndaghu dusambu dji baSwife. Yivunde yeni akekebwaghe va makulu ma Djesu na akemulende yiri: «Rughe o ndaghu ami.» <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Payi amavaghe nane, mumbari amabe na mwane divingu di mughetu wu dighumi na bilime bibedji (12) amamongaange.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ave Djesu amawendilaange, amabe va ghari yinombu na bakeyenemubandesenaange yari na yari. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Va ghari owu, vamabe mughetu awumabe na muvuve malungu mu dighumi na bilime bibedji (12). Mughetu eni, akemane maboti mandi motsu na babuyitsi, tumbe ne wumosi asarunguse umubeluse. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Anobambene va nzime Djesu, akebembe difubu di yikutu yandi. Vane-vane, muvuve malungu ukekamughe. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Djesu akewivule rye: «Anyi atsimbembe?» Botsu bakeghale. Pyere akemuwake rye: «Fumu, yinombu yiwutsyenge, na yiwubandesene yari na yari.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Tumbe Djesu aketsiyise rye: «Mutu atsimbembe mumbari nyitsiwulu mangolu matsimapale mu menu.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mughetu eni, anolabe yiri bamamubaghule, akerughe noregheme na akekebwaghe va makulu ma Djesu, aketubule dibandu adi amamubembile va wusu mughungi, na nane amasunde ubeluyile. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Djesu akemutsingule rye: «Mwane ami, yitu yaghu yimaghughobule, wendangaange na duvotsu.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Djesu uvose mbé akivose na mughetu eni, vakerughe yilumbi o dimbu di yivunde yi baSwife novose rye: «Wuyabwékungise wa Mulonzi, mwane amafu.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Tumbe Djesu anowulu nane, aketsingule yivunde yeni: «Wuyalabe ghome, vaghe yike yitu, na mwane aghu oghobulu.» <verse eid="LUK 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Anotole o ndaghu Sayirise, asamagharusu mutu ususu ukote nandi, yike vane Pyere, San, Sake, tadji na ngudji mwane. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Botsu bamatataange nolilaange mwane eni. Djesu akebatsingule rye: «Duyabwelile, mwane agha afu, tumbe adji yilu.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Na batu beni bakemupedjingi, mumbari bamadjabaange yiri mwane afu kale. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Tumbe Djesu akemughaange mu dikake novose na mangolu rye: «Mwane, releme!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Vane-vane, akeghabughe monyu, akereleme. Djesu akebarume umuveghe bighudji. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Biburu bi mwane eni mughetu bakesutu, na Djesu akebaghandise yiri duyabile utsingule mutu adibanovyoghe.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esindiyi dighumi na bilumbi bibedji o yisalu yi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mrk 6.7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Djesu enengili dighumi na babedji (12) na ebaveyi mangolu na dirume mu binyuni byotsu bibi, na mu ubeluse bibedu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Akebatinde mu uyenesamune Bukaghe bu Nzambi na mu ubeluse bibedu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Akebatsingule rye: «Ave dulingile, duyabeghe yime: ne duvengu, ne komi, ne mbongu, ne dipe ne bidjunge bibedji. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ndaghu adjududile, tsananu mune tena durambughe. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Mbure tsyotsu atsyubuse ududile, ghusughanu musyengi owu, mbana kukanu difufundu di makulu menu, dyoni dyube nane bumbedji abubafundise.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Badukitsi beni bamasogheme, na bamayenewendaange, mu mimbu, mu uyenesamunaange musamu wuboti noyenebelusaange bibedu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yirode amarondaange ulabe Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mrk 6.14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Yirode murumitsi wu Ngalile, anowulu motsu amamavaghungu, akesutu mumbari bapwele bamavosaange rye: «San-Batise amarambughe o dufu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Bane bakevosaange yiri: «Eli amabwéghabughe monyu.» Bamosi bakevosaange yi: «Mubiyitsi wukale wumaghabughe monyu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Tumbe Yirode amavosaange yiri: «Menu nyimarumise baketabule San-Batise muru. Yike nyi esalisi mambu ame menu nyiwulu?» Mu dyoni, amarondaange ulabe Djesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu na badukitsi bandi bébunguli mughungi wuneni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mrk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">San 6.1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Bilumbi djowandi bamatsingule Djesu motsu amebamadughusungu. Djesu akebanengile na bakevengeme o musyengi winengulu Besayide. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Yinombu yinomulabe, yikemuduke. Djesu na badukitsi bandi bakebadile. Djesu amabasayimine na amalonze Bukaghe bu Nzambi, nobeluse botsu abamabe na nzale dubelusu. <verse eid="LUK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Wisi wunobande wutsime, dighumi na badukitsi bandi babedji (12) bakebambene na Djesu nomutsingule rye: «Tsyéghanini yinombu yikenewende mu mimbu na mu masaku, mu yenerombe bighudji na mambure ma yilatsi, mumbari tudji va kumu dukange.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Tumbe Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Djenubeni, baveyanu bighudji!» Bilumbi bakemuwalu rye: «Djetu, tune bu mape maranu na nyame bedji tsi mambe. Wirondi bwena tuwendi mu yésumbe bighudji bi batu botsu babe?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Vane, vamabe tosini-yiranu (5 000) tsi batu. Djesu aketsingule badukitsi bandi rye: «Batsanisyanu mu maghuki ma maghumi-maranu (50) ma batu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Badukitsi bakemudedile na bakebatsanise. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Djesu akebonge mape meni maranu na nyame tsyeni tsibedji. Akenangule misu na djulu, akeghabusile Nzambi diboti mu bighudji byeni, akebitabule na akebiwakise badukitsi bandi na bakeghabile yinombu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Botsu abamadji, bakeghukuru. Bibuku abimasyalulu, bikebase dighumi na ponzi bedji (12).<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyere etubuli bwendiri Djesu la Kirisete</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-21">Mat 16.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-31">Mrk 8.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:67-71">San 6.67-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Yilumbu yimosi Djesu amasambilaange pinze va mughule, badukitsi bandi wandi bamabe vane. Akebawivule rye: «Yi yinombu yivosi mu menu?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Bakemuwaghule rye: «Abane bévosi rye wudji San-Batise, bamosi bakevosaange rye wudji Eli mubiyitsi, basusu bakevosaange bwé wudji mubiyitsi wukale awumarambughe o dufu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Akebwébawivule rye: «Ka djenu, yi dwitasi? Anyi nyivu?» Pyere akewake rye: «Wudji Kirisete, mwane Nzambi adjivu monyu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebalonzi nane ofwile na nane orambuyile o dufu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-24">Mat 16.20-24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-33">Mrk 8.30-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Djesu amabaghandise kilikingi duyaditsingule mutu. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Na amabwele rye: «Mwane Mutu olabe maghughe maneni. Bivunde bi baSwife, bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na milonzi mi mighaghe bomubuse, oboku na mu yilumbu ayimuryeru orambughe o dufu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsyeni mutu orungulile udukile Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Mat 16.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Mrk 8.34—9.1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Mba amatsingule mughungi rye: «Payi mutu erondi unduke, alekeghale djabeni, ananguli kurusu andi kale yilumbu na anduki. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Nyidutsinguli: Wotsu oronde wughaghe monyu andi, owuvinde; tumbe djandi awu owutsyemuse dibandu menu, omwéwudile. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Ubwedji yi wuvu ombu mutu awirondi udile maboti motsu ma butambe, mbana aketsyemuse vo akebunge monyu andi? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Payi mutu olabe yisoni mu menu na mu mambu mami, Mwane Mutu omulabe yisoni ave oruyile mu bundumbe bwandi, na bu Tadji na bu byanze bi Nzambi abivu bisyeme. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Dingenze, nyidutsinguli rye: bamosi abavu vave bagholefu, pa bakalabe dulasu du Bukaghe bu Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ekaluyi yidimu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mrk 9.2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Banovyose tsone, mu yilumbu ayi munane, Djesu akenengile Pyere, San na Sake na bakemate o mukongu muyésambile. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Ave bamasambililaange yinzi yandi yikekademe na yikutu yandi yike veme «vee». <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Sundile, va malabene babaale babedji bamamoghaange nandi: Moyise na Eli. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Djowu abamalabene va ghari bundumbe bu Nzambi, bakevosaange na Djesu mu djabe nane omanine yisalu yandi ne akeyefu o Serusaleme. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Pyere na bambatsi, bamabe bilu. Tumbe banorambughe yilu nonyighe misu, bamalabe bundumbe bu Djesu na babaale babedji abamabe nandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Yike babaale beni banobe beli nowende, Pyere amavose na Djesu rye: «Fumu, dibwedji yiri tubyanu vave. Turungyanu mirumbe miryeru: wumosi awaghu, wususu wu Moyise, awune wu Eli. Payi Pyere avose nane, mumbari asamadjabaange adi amavosaange.» <verse eid="LUK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Ave amavosilaange nane, dimungi dimasundughe na dimabaghumbe na yidumbitsi yandi. Pyere na bambatsi babedji bakeghangu na ghome ave bamalabile dimungi dimabaghumbe. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>O ghari dimungi umawulunu dyufi dimavose rye: «Awuwu la Mwane ami awu nyimasole, muwululwanu!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Dyufi dyeni dinovole, bamalabe yike Djesu bwandi. Mu temu eni, Pyere na bambatsi babedji bakelévole, na basamatsingule batu adibamalabe.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dubelusu du mwane awuvu na yinyuni yibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mrk 9.14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Yilumbu ayimaduke, Djesu na badukitsi baryeru bamavindeme mukongu. Yinombu yineni yimabengusunu Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Va ghari yinombu, dibaale dimosi akeghamughe rye: «Mulonzi kokolu tsyaghu, lase mwane ami divingu yingebe! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Payi Yinyuni yibive yimamughaange, mwane eghamuyingi, esibuyingi, epalisingi difwitse. Yimunemisingi, yibu umuboke na yighegharu umudunde. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Nyitsilende badukitsi baghu bakeyisanze, tumbe bagharungule.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Djesu amawake rye: «Kamune paghe dji, djenu batu babi, dune mirime mighale. Temu kweni nyuwarilaange kemi tsyenu? Beghe mwane aghu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Ave mwane amabambininaange na Djesu, Yinyuni yeni yibive yimamukungise na mangolu, yikemubete. Djesu akeyinyangile noyisanze. Mwane akebelughe, mbana Djesu akemughabusile tadji andi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Botsu bakesutu dibandu buneni bu Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Djesu ebwévose mu dufu na durambughe dwandi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mrk 9.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Vo batu bamanyungilaange ame Djesu amavaghaange, aketsingule badukitsi bandi rye: <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«Wulwanu na ghangisanu motsu ame nyikidutsingule vave: Mwane Mutu osumbusu na batu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Tumbe basamatsiyise adi amavosaange. Basamawulu divindughulu mumbari dimabe yikeke mumba bakéjabe divindughulu. Bamalabe ghome mu mwémuwivule dyoni.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyi avu yivunde?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mrk 9.33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Badukitsi baketsundaange mu djabe anyi avu yivunde mu djowu botsu. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Djesu anodjabe matase ma mirime myowu, amabeghe mwane ngebi, akemurelighe va mughule andi, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>novose rye: «Wotsu edili mwane nane wughu mu dine dyami, endili. Wotsu endili, edili djandi omanzindighe, mumbari wotsu odjivu agheyi va ghari enu, djandi la yivunde.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awu agha mbeni enu, mutu enu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mrk 9.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>San akevose rye: «Fumu, tutsilabe mutu atsisanzaange binyuni bibi na mangolu ma dine dyaghu. Tutsimughandise mumbari agha netu mukonge.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Tumbe, Djesu akemuwaghule rye: «Duyabwémughandise, mumbari wotsu agha mbeni enu, mutu enu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bise Samari bebusi Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 4:9-20">San 4.9-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Djesu anolabe yiri temu adji omatile o djulu yike wutole djitoli, akeghane kake djuwende o Serusaleme. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Djesu akeretse bilumbi, bakewende, baketole o dimbu di bise Samari mu yemukunzile mbure. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Tumbe batu ba dimbu dyeni, bakebuse wubadile mumbari bamadjabaange yiri o Serusaleme ewendi. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Ave badukitsi Sake na San bamadighululu, bakewivule rye: «Fumu, wirondi yiri turumi mudji awu wiruli o djulu wukebasyeghesene?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Djesu akeghelughe ombu wowu, akebasyembe. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Na bamawende o dimbu dimosi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abérondi uduke Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8.19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Ave bamabile mu nzile, mutu amatsingule Djesu rye: «Nyuyenewendaange naghu mbure tsyotsu atsiwuwendaange.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Djesu akemuwaghule rye: «Bitsalale bine midunge na batsoli bane muve, tumbe Mwane Mutu aghaane mbure djuvumine nosikile muru.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Ombu wumosi, Djesu akevose rye: «Nduki.» Tumbe mutu eni akemuwaghule: «Kokolu Fumu, lépeghe musughe muleyétsighe tadji ami.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Djesu akemuwaghule rye: «Dunde abafu batswiyi bamvumbi nowu, tumbe ndedju wende, yesamune Bukaghe bu Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Wususu akebwévose rye: «Fumu, nyirondi uwende naghu, tumbe nyileyeghanine batu ba ndaghu ami.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Djesu akemuwaghule rye: «Mutu wotsu oyibandi wusole yilu mu nungi na mukwati, yinzi na nzime, agha awelimine mu Bukaghe bu Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esindiyi maghumi dusambwali na badukitsi babedji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mat 9.37-38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:7-16">10.7-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Va djulu vane, Fumu akesole maghumi-dusambwali na badukitsi babedji (72) basusu. Akebasindighe babe babedji mu misyengi na mbure tsyotsu atsi djabeni mbé olingule. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Akebatsingule rye: «Nungi djimawele, vake dighumbe, basatsi bagha pwele, kaboghu sambilanu Fumu nungi akebwese basatsi. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Wendanu, lanu nyidusindiyi nane baane ba bindombu va ghari baminzi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Duyabonge dibumbe di mbongu vo komi ne bapondu. Mu nzile, duyasimbe mutu. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Mu mandaghu motsu ameduyenekotaange, lévosanganu rye: “Duvotsu dubi mu ndaghu édjidji.” <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Pavadji mutu duvotsu, dwoni dubi mu mutu eni. Patsi nane, dwoni dudughabuyili. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Tsananu mu ndaghu eni, djanganu na nwanganu byotsu abiboduveghe mumbari musatsi awelimine na fute andi. Duyabe duyawende ndaghu na ndaghu. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Musyengi wotsu awu duyenekotaange, ave boduwakile, djanganu abiboduveghe. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Belusanu bibedu abi durasunu, batsingulyanu rye: Bukaghe bu Nzambi bumabambene nenu. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Tumbe, musyengi awughoduwake, palanu mu mbure tsi mighungi, batsingulyanu rye: <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>“Twighubuli mu djenu difufundu di musyengi enu aditsiname mu makulu metu, tumbe djabanu yiri Bukaghe bu Nzambi buke bebeli.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Nyidutsinguli rye: Mu yilumbu yi bunzonzi bu Fumu, bise musyengi eni bokilusu wuvyolile bise Sodome.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Misyengi amibusi wuvayile yitu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11.20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>«Maghughe ombu ndedju Korasi, maghughe ombu ndewandi Besayide. Mumbari, bimaghe abitsilabane ombu wenu, mbé o Tire na Sidone, yileme nabubu mbé bamadwarile basyele nogholene dibufu muvonde kokolu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Ladibandu, va yilumbu yi bunzonzi bu Nzambi, misyengi mi Tire na Sidone mighokambusu pwele nane djenu. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Na ndedju wandi Kapernawume, witasi bwena wumatusu o djulu? Djabanu yiri dudyamusu nobwaghu o bulongu bu djowu abafu.» <verse eid="LUK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Djesu akebwétsingule badukitsi bandi rye:</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 10:16">«Oyiduwululu, ekululu;</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 10:16">oyidunyaghuli, endyaghuli;</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 10:16">oyinyaghuli menu,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 10:16">enyaghuli wandi omanzindighe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa 14.13-15</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dughabughulu du maghumi dusambwali na badukitsi babedji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:12">Mrk 6.12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:17-20">Mrk 16.17-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Maghumi-dusambwali na badukitsi babedji (72) bamaghabughe na nzangu novose rye: «Fumu, ne binyuni bibi bimatudedilaange ave tumabiruminaange mu dine dyaghu.» <verse eid="LUK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Djesu akebatsinguli rye: «Nyimalabe Dyabu amabondughaange o djulu nane dusyemu du kaki. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Lanu, nyimaduveghe musughe utsyarile banyoghe, bakuru na mangolu motsu ma mbeni na vaghobe yime yudukambise. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Tumbe duyabe na nzangu mumbari binyuni bidudedili. Tumbe saghanu mumbari mine menu masonughu o djulu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzangu Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">Mat 13.16-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Vane-vane, Djesu akebase na nzangu dji Yinyuni Yisyeme noghamughe rye: «Tate, nyiwudodisi, Fumu djulu na butambe mumbari wumasweghe mambu meni mama ombu bango dyele na dudjabu, wumamalase ombu bangebi. Nine Tate, mumbari wutsironde yiri dyube nane.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Tate ami, amapeghe bimi byotsu. Vagha mutu edjabi Mwane payi tsi Tadji, vo Tadji payi tsi Mwane, na abe Mwane erondi udjabise Tadji.» <verse eid="LUK 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Djesu anoghelughe ombu badukitsi bandi, o fundu akebatsingule rye: «Ubwedji ombu djenu abedwilabi mambu meni mame amedwilabi! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Mbana, nyidutsinguli rye: babiyitsi na Kaghe tsipwele bamaronde wulabe abi djenu dwilabi tumbe basamabilabe. Na bamaronde uwulu amedwiwulu na basamamawulu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji mwise Samari</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mrk 12.28-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Mulonzi wumosi wu mighaghe, amareleme mu wélighe Djesu. Akemutsingule rye: «Mulonzi yi nyuvaghe mudile monyu mutubu na mutubu?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yike Djesu akemuwivule rye: «Mu mughaghe Moyise, yi basonighe? Tsyeni wiwuwululu?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Dibaale dyeni dikemuwaghule rye: «“Wurondaange Fumu Nzambi aghu na murime wotsu, na muvumu aghu wotsu, na mangolu maghu motsu, na matase maghu motsu.” Mba nane, “Wurondaange mutu naghu nane ndebeni<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Det 6.5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Djesu akemusingisile nomutsingule rye: «Vaghe nane, wudile monyu.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Tumbe djandi akeronde wukekaghule, nowivule Djesu rye: «Anyi avu mutu nami?»<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Djesu akebatsingule rye: «Wumabe mutu wune amarambuyilaange o Serusaleme mu vindeme o musyengi Seriku. Va ghari nzile akeghangu na bikongu, bakemudimbe nomupatule bikutu abimabe nandi na bakemusile peni, aketabughe nyambu, bakemusila noyenewende. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Muvaghulitsi paghu amavyoyilaange mu nzile eni, anolabe mutu eni akemughonge, akenewende. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Musalitsi wu ndaghu Nzambi wu mwise Levi, aketole vane, akelabe mutu eni, akemughonge djawandi akenewende. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Tumbe mwise Samari amabe mu mulingu andi, aketole vane, anomulabe, akebase na yingebe. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Anobambene nandi, akemutsindule malungu, akewitile matsi na malamu mu mubughe mapure. Akemunangighe va djulu buru adjimenemubeghaange, akemubeghe o ndaghu beni bakemukelise na burange.<figure style="fig" alt="Nongu dji mwise Samari" file="WA03863b.tif" size="col" loc="10.30-35" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="10.34"/> <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Ave kedi, amaveghe fumu ndaghu beni fure bedji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">fure bedji: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbongu tsyeni, fute bilumbu bibedji bi yisalu va temu eni.</char></note> novose rye: “Munkelisili na burange, byotsu abi wuvaghe mu djandi, nyughughabusile ave nyurule.”»<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Djesu akemuwivule rye: «Tsyeni witasili? Va ghari djowu baryeru, anyi amalase mutu awu bikongu bamadimbe yiri adji mutu nandi?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Mulonzi eni mighaghe akemuwaghule: «Djandi omamuwamuse.» Djesu akemutsingule rye:</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 10:37">«Ndewandi, wende.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 10:37">Vaghaange nane djandi.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ombu Marete na Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Djesu amabe mu nzile na badukitsi bandi, baketole va dimbu, mughetu benengili Marete akebawake o ndaghu andi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Mari mwane ngudji andi amabe bu atsane va ditoghu va wusu Fumu mu ulungu musamu awu djandi amalonzaange. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Marete amavungilaange bu mu bisalu muwake beni. Akebambene na Fumu nomuwivule rye: «Fumu, nde wilabi ubwedji vane mwane ngudji ami enzili pinze na bisalu byotsu? Mutsinguli, akwamusi!» <verse eid="LUK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Fumu akemuwaghule rye: «Marete, Marete! Yi witsirili murime noketsoyise na matase mu mambu mapwele? <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Tumbe, dyambu dimosi bwandi diwelimine. Mari, atsisole dyambu diboti adighomupatulu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu evosi mu dyambu di dusambu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Vamabe yilumbu, Djesu amasambilaange va mwa mbure. Anomane, wumosi mu badukitsi bandi amamuwivule rye: «Fumu, tulonzi wusambile Nzambi nane San amalonzile badukitsi bandi.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Lanu, ave dusambililaange, vosanganu rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Tate etu, adjivu o djulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">dine dyaghu dibi disyeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">bukaghe bwaghu buruyi.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Tuveyi bighudji bi kadi yilumbu.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Tutandi mabi metu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">nane twitandili djetu wandi abetuvayi mabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">wuyatusile mu dumangu.”»<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uvonde na yiswebiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Djesu amamwébatsingule rye: «Payi mutu wumosi va ghari enu ane mbatsi, na eyimukokumune va ghari wisi, nomunengile: “Mbatsi ami, nzombisi mape maryeru, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>mbatsi ami mosi amarughe o wulinge, na ngaane yime yumuveghe.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Ka yike mbatsi eni emuwaghuli o ghari ndaghu andi rye: “Sile menu, nyimadibighe ndaghu, menu na baane bami tumabundeme, ngobwésimbughe muyighuveghe mape.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Nyidutsinguli, yike esimbuyi mu muveghe byotsu abi erondi, tsi mu yimbatsi ayivu va ghari owu, tumbe mumbari emuvondi na yiswebiri. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Menu, nyidutsinguli bwé: Vondanu, na boduveghe; rombanu, na dubaghule; dukisanu na bodudibulile mune ndaghu. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Mumbari, oyivondi, edili; oyirombi, ebaghuli; na bédibulili mune ndaghu ombu oyidukisi.<verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Payi mwane evondi nyame mambe, tadji nyi va ghari enu orungule umuveghe pili? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Vo omuveghe kuru payi emuvondi dyaki? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Babi nane djenu dwidjabi uveghe bime bi bwedji ombu baane benu, tambusu na Tadji enu adjivu o djulu, tsyeni aghoveyile Yinyuni Yisyeme ombu djowu abemuvondi?»<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dubelusu du dibabe na Djesu ewaghuli djowu abemufwengilili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mrk 3.22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Djesu amasanze Yinyuni yibi ombu dibaale di dibabe. Yinyuni yeni yinopale, dibaale dyeni dikevose. Yinombu yi batu yikesutu yikebase na yinyunge. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Tumbe bane bamavose rye: «Belesebule, yivunde yi binyuni bibi yimuveyi mangolu mosanze binyuni!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Bamosi, mu wélighe durumu dwandi, bamamuwivule yiri alasi yilimbe ayiruyili ombu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Tumbe Djesu anodjabe matase mowu, amavose rye: «Bulongu bwotsu abu batu bétoyi djobeni na djobeni, butsyemughe, na mandaghu mowu merakuyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Dwivosi yiri menu nyisanzi binyuni bibi na mangolu ma Belesebule. Payi ngenze Dyabu ekétoyise djabeni, mumbari yi bukaghe bwandi bubile buware? <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Payi dwitasi yiri menu, nyibisanzi na mangolu ma Belesebule, ka baane benu abebisanzi wandi nane menu, mangolu mowu anyi ebaveyi? Baane ba djenubeni bodufundise! <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Tumbe, payi na mangolu ma Nzambi nyibisanzili, Bukaghe bu Nzambi buke va ghari enu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Payi mutu mangolu na bitoghulu byandi, ekelisi ndaghu andi, busine bwandi bwotsu bukandu. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Tumbe yikeveruyi mutu wumuvyoghulile mangolu, emubeti, emupatuli bitoghulu abi atsivayilaange yitu, eghabi byotsu abi mbé bikevu nandi.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>Awu agha nami, epini.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 11:23">Awu aghéghukiyi batu nami, epanzi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dughabughulu du yinyuni yibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Ave Yinyuni yibive yipalili mu mutu, yiwendi mu mbure tsi wumughe mu rombe yitsanunu. Payi yighaayidile, yivosi rye: “Nyughabughe o ndaghu ami adji nyitsirambuyile.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Eghabuyi, edjirasunu djimaghombulu, djimakunzu. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Kaboghu yiwendi muyélande yisambwali yi binyuni abimuvyoghulile wubi. Béruyi va mosi, békoti mu ndaghu eni na bétsani. Na dighughe di mutu eni divyoghulili aditeghe.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwedji awungenze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Djesu anomane uvose mambu meni, mughetu akeghamughe va ghari yinombu rye: «Ubwedji ombu mughetu omaghukelise o modji na omaghunwise!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Djesu akemuwaghule rye: «Nesi, tumbe ubwedji ombu djowu abewulu mbembu Nzambi na bédjidedili nodjisalise!»<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Batu bévondi Djesu yimaghe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Yinombu yi batu yimarughesene pwele va wusu andi, akevose rye: «Batu ba temu édjidji babive, bévondi yilimbe yi yimaghe, tumbe yimaghe yi yubalasu, patsi yi mubiyitsi Sonase? <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Ngenze nane Sonase amabile yilimbe yi bise Ninive, anane Mwane Mutu obe yilimbe mu batu ba temu édjidji. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Mu yilumbu yi mufundu djulu, kaghe mughetu bise bande bulongu oreleme va wusu batu ba temu eni djidji, mu ubatabulile bunzonzi. Odisalise mumbari amarule o malongu ma vale mu uyiwulu malongi ma dyele di kaghe Salemu. Vave, vadji Mutu avyoghulile Salemu! <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Mu yilumbu yi mufundu, bise Ninive boreleme va wusu batu ba temu eni djidji na boduveghe mbele, mumbari djowu bamakalughe dyele mu musamu Sonase!»<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yidjalale yi dunyuru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>«Vagha mutu ebanzi paghe mu udjisweghe otsi ponzi vo otsi tangi, tumbe edjisunzi va djulu dingase mumbari botsu abokotaange bakelaba yidjalale. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Disu dyaghu la lambi dunyuru dwaghu. Payi disu dyaghu dighebeli, dunyuru dwaghu dudji mu yidjalale. Tumbe payi disu dyaghu dibeli, dunyuru dwaghu dudji otsi piseme. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Kaboghu kebene, yidjalale ayivu mu ndedju yikebe piseme. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Payi dunyuru dwaghu dwotsu dudji mu yidjalale, ughaane mbure djivu otsi piseme, udji ndedju wotsu mu yidjalale, nane mwinde wighumonitsili na yidjalale yandi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esyembi baFarisi na milonzi mi mighaghe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrk 12.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Djesu anomane uvose, muFarisi wumosi akemunengile o udji o ndaghu andi. Djesu amakote akevyoghe va tavule. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Anolabe bwena Djesu aghasuse makake ne akedji, muFarisi eni amakambulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Kaboghu Fumu akemutsingule rye: «La nane duvu, djenu baFarisi, dwilyomisi yike yidju-djulu yi dimoyi na yi yipele, tumbe o ghari tsyenu, dubase na nzale udaghe na mambu mabive. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Biduke bi batu nane djenu! Omasale yidju-djulu, tsiri djandi amasale ghari wandi? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Kaboghu, diwelimine yiri duveghaange ombu bidjaghe byotsu abiwelimine mu bipele byenu, mbana menu motsu molyome.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>Maghughe ombu djenu baFarisi dwiveyi ombu Nzambi yimosi mu dighumi yi bivaru abibendi mu manyengi menu: ngambu, disosu na bimosi. Tumbe dwilibini usalise dusungughu na durondu du Nzambi. Abine mbé dwireli uvaghe na dugholibene mane. <verse eid="LUK 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>Maghughe ombu djenu baFarisi, dwirondingi bitsighe biteghe mu mandaghu ma dusambu, na dwirondingi uveghu mbolu va ghari mughungi. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Maghughe ombu djenu, dudji nane bambine bamaghulene, na batu ave bévyoyili mune bétsyarile nzoruru mumbari mughaa bilimbe!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Mulonzi wumosi wu mighaghe akemutsingule rye: «Mulonzi, vo wivosili nane, djetu wandi wisyengi!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Djesu akewaghule: «Maghughe ombu djenu wandi milonzi mi mighaghe, dwinangusi batu mifune mirange ubeghu, mbana dughesisini ne mulembu wumosi mu ubawamuse. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Kamune maghughe ma dulabe? Dwibumbi bangile tsi babiyitsi, abe batadji benu bamaboke. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Kaboghu, dudji kingu mosi na batadji benu, mumbari djowu bamaboke babiyitsi beni, na djenu dwirungi bangile bowu. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Ladibandu, Nzambi na dyele dyandi amavosile rye: “Nyubatindile babiyitsi na bilumbi, boboke bamosi, bakekwane basusu.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Kaboghu, batu ba temu eni djidji, boveghu mbele mu dyambu di babiyitsi abamaboku, ubongile vane dibandu di bulongu. <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>Dimabandile vane bamavunine Abele kwange na dufu du Sakari, omaboku va ghari yinyenzulu yi paghu na ndaghu Nzambi. Nine, nyidutsinguli yiri, batu ba temu eni djidji, bowivulu dibandu di malungu meni! <verse eid="LUK 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>Maghughe ombu djenu milonzi mi mighaghe, adumasweghe sabi adjiveyi dudjabu du mambu ma Nzambi. Dughadukote djenubeni, mbana dwighandise ne bo mbé baronde ukote.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Djesu anopale o ndaghu eni, Milonzi mi mighaghe na baFarisi, bamabande wumutsuyise nomuwivule bivu mu mambu mapwele, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>kwivululu dji dyele mu ulabe yiri bowulu mbembu bive djupale mu munu andi.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu elubusi bango pende-pyalu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10.26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Va temu eni, yinombu yi batu yimawungene tena yimayenetsyarsenaange. Djesu akelevose na badukitsi bandi nobatsingule rye: «Kebenanu na pende-pyalu baFarisi abavu nane yifunisi ayi bésobini mu pate-mape<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yifunisi ayi bésobini mu pate-mape: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">va temu kale, baghetu bamasobenaange puse mu urandise pate-mape, mu bumbighe ne bakeghoke mape mowu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Vagha dyambu disweme adighodjabunu, ne yikeke ayighobaghulu. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Ladibandu: Motsu duvosaange otsi piseme, mowulunu o yidjalale; ame dungungerenaange mu bibuku bi mandaghu, motubulu va ngande, mbanane mowanzulu mwanzu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyi abwedji udumu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10.28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>«Nyidutsinguli djenu aduvu bambatsi bami, duyabe na ghome ombu djowu abeboki dunyuru, mumbari baghorungule uduvaghe dyambu disusu. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Nyudulase vengu awu dudume: dumanu Nzambi mumbari payi dumafu, orungule ubwaghe yinyuni wandi o dyange di mudji. Nine, djandi awu dudume.<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Baghesumbisi tsoli yiranu tsigheyi mu fure bedji? Nzambi aghélibini ne djimosi. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Ne nange tsyenu tsyotsu tsi myuru tsitalu. Duyadume, djenu duvyoghulile batsoli.»<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyeme vo ughale Djesu Kirisete</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Mat 10.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>«Nyidutsinguli, wotsu onyeme menu va kande batu, Mwane Mutu wandi omunyeme va wusu byanze bi Nzambi novose rye: awuwu mutu ami. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Tumbe owughale menu va misu ma batu, mewandi nyumughale va wusu byanze bi Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Awu ovose kulini mu Mwane Mutu, otandu, tumbe awu ulenze Yinyuni Yisyeme, aghotandu.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>Payi bodusosise mu mandaghu ma tsambu ma baSwife va wusu banzonzi na barumitsi, duyalabe ghome mu motsu duvose mu kekaghule. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Yinyuni Yisyeme yuduveghe vane-vane mambu ame durungule uvose.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji yisine yi yiduke</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:26">Mat 16.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:19-26">Luk 16.19-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Mutu wumosi va ghari yinombu akevose na Djesu rye: «Mulonzi, tsingule mwane ngudji ami yiri tughabini disyale.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Djesu akemuwake rye: «Dibaale, anyi atsimbyatse nzonzi enu umudughabile disyale dyenu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Mbana, akelubuse botsu rye: «Kebananu na nzale neni dji busine, mumbari monyu mutu wughaa mu durangu du bime abivu nandi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Na akebabukile nongu: «Manungi ma yisine ma mabure bighudji bipwele. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Na akekéwivulaange yiri: “Tsyeni ngavayile? Ngaane bitale biwelimine byusweyile dighumbe. <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Kaboghu, nyupanze bitale byotsu, na nyurunge bisweghulu abineni, mu ukelise bighudji na maboti mami motsu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Nyukésingisile mebeni: Labe, wuke na maboti mapwele bilime na bilime, tsyétsani, djangaange, nwangaange mbana saghaange.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Tumbe Nzambi akemutsingule: “Kamune yiduke yi, na mukolu eni wuwu wufu. Maboti motsu ameghutsighukighe na nyi mosyale?”» <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Djesu akebwévose rye: «Anane dyube ombu mutu oyighukiyi busine mu djabeni, tumbe aghaane busine mu mambu ma Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ube na yitu mu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Djesu akevose na badukitsi bandi rye: «Ladibandu, nyidutsinguli: duyabe na munyongu mu monyu enu mu dyambu di bighudji. Duyabe na munyongu mu dunyuru dwenu mu dyambu di bidwaru. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Djabanu rye: monyu wuvyoghulile bighudji; dunyuru duvyoghulile bidwaru. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Labatyanu bavange! Baghevari, baghedokuli milunde, baghaane bitale vo mireri, tumbe Nzambi ebabunguli. Tambusu na djenu batu, duvyoghulile batsoli dighobe. <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Anyi na manyoni mandi, orungule wukebwese mwa pesu temu mu monyu andi? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Payi dughorungule wutsonzighe dyambu digheyi, dibandu yi dubile na manyoni mu masusu? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Labatyanu nane tsangu tsifulili mu biriri bi musiru, tsighesali, tsigherariyi bikutu. Nyidutsinguli: ne kaghe Salemu, mu bundumbe bwandi bwotsu, asamadwaraange burange nane tsangu tsyeni. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Kaboghu, yi dubile na yitu yi gheyi? Payi Nzambi ebwedjisi tsangu eni yilumbu yéyiyi adjunyenzu mughese, tambusu na djenu batu, tsyeni aghorungulile wududwisile? <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Djenu, duyalabe keri mu abi dudji vo abi dunu. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Byotsu bine, bise bulongu abaghabaware mu Nzambi bebirombi. Tadji enu adjivu o djulu edjabi nzale tsyenu. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Tumbe djenu, lerombanu Bukaghe bu Nzambi na byotsu bine, byuduveghu va djudjulu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Busine bu Bufumu bu djulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>«Djenu mughambe wugheyi wu bindombu, duyalabe keri, Tadji enu atsisole uduveghe Bukaghe bu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Sumbisanu abivu nenu na veghanu mbongu ombu bidjaghe. Anane dukerungile komi adjighofu na dughukighe busine abughosuke o djulu, abughobembu na badayi, ne batsyelili baghobubunge. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Mumbari ave busine bwenu buvu, avane murime wandi wuvu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Basalitsi abemoyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:33-37">Mrk 13.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:42-44">Mat 24.42-44</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat 25.1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>«Warisanu matsande menu na banzanu lambi tsyenu. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Banu nane basalitsi abevivi fumu owu atsiwende o mulambu udiwele, bebi batsonzeme mu umudibulile mune ndaghu ave oghabuyile na edukisi. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Ubwedji ombu basalitsi abomoghaange mu uvive fumu owu. Payi ditsibe nane, dingenze, nyidutsinguli: owarise tsande andi, obanengile va tavule, na djabeni obaghabile bighudji. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Akerughe va ghari wisi vo va matebughulu, ubwedji ombu basalitsi abe erasunu bemoyi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>«Ghulwatyanu, fumu ndaghu mbé edjabi temu adji mudayi oruyili mu uyibule ndaghu, nyitasi rye mbé omoghe mu ughaghe ndaghu andi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Djenu wandi banu dukunzeme mumbari dughejabi temu adji Mwane Mutu oruyile.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musalitsi wuwelimine na musalitsi dyengule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24.45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Pyere akewivule rye: «Fumu, djetu wibukili nongu edjine vo batu botsu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Fumu akemuwaghule rye: «Musalitsi wusigheme na awuvu na dyele anyi? Djandi o fumu oveghe musughe wukelise ndaghu andi noghabilaange basalitsi abane bighudji mu temu adjiwelimine. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Ubwedji ombu musalitsi eni o fumu ndaghu oyirasunu ekelisi ndaghu andi. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Dingenze nyidutsinguli: fumu ndaghu omuveghe musughe mu urumise busine bwandi bwotsu. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Tumbe, musalitsi eni amavose mu murime andi rye: “Fumu ami agholerughe.” Djandi yikebi mu udimbise basalitsi ba babaale na ba baghetu, na yikebwébe mu udji, mu unu na mu ulange. <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Yikevayi nane, fumu andi orughe mu temu adji djandi aghodjabe. Omubinge mbana omughabile fute adjiwelimine na djowu abaghabasungeme. <verse eid="LUK 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Kaboghu, musalitsi awidjabi adi fumu andi erondi, mba aghedivayi, odimbusu kube neni. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Tumbe musalitsi awughesali bisalu abi fumu andi erondi, mumbari aghejabi adiwelimine ombu fumu andi, okilusu mwa pesu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 12:48">Awu béveyi pwele, otsundusu pwele.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 12:48">Awu edili pwe-pwele, owivulu pwe-pwele wandi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Duvotsu vo dupasu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>«Nzirughe o uyibwaghe mudji mu butambe, nyirondi bwena wukelulaange. <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Vengu nyubatusu, kamune munyongu wuvu nami tena dyoni dyudughusu! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Dwitasi yiri nyimarughe mu butambe mu udubeyile duvotsu? Nesi, tsi duvotsu, tumbe dupasu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Ubongile na muni, mukute wu batu baranu wukakene, baryeru bovine babedji, na babedji bovine baryeru. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Tadji ovine mwane andi na mwane ovine tadji andi; ngudji ovine mwane andi na mwane ovine ngudji andi. Ngudji mwane dibaale ovine mughatsi mwane andi; mughatsi mwane ovine ngudji mulumi andi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kelulanu batemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:1-3">Mat 16.1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Djesu akebwévose na yinombu rye: «Ave dwilabili didudumbi diruyisini o wisi eputumini, dwivosi bwena, “mvule onoghe”, na djoni djinoyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Ave dwiwululu mupunge wipepili o yari yi bande, dwivosi yiri “vobe yusile” na yusile yeni yibi. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Bapende nane djenu, ave dwighengili djulu na butambe, dwidjabi wukelule yidenzi yi mvule na yi mungudi. Yike tsyeni dugherungusili wudjabile mambu ma temu édjidji?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwulusunu na bambeni betu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5.25-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>«Dibandu yi dughekelulingi djenubeni mambu na murime wuwelimine? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Payi mutu naghu amaghufwengilile dyambu, ave eghubeyili o mufundu, ditsonziyi nandi mu nzile, ne duketole ombu nzonzi. Mumbari nzonzi akeghuwakise ombu yivunde yi baghore, na baghore beni bakeghukotise o tsughu. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Nyighutsinguli: wugholepale o tsughu, payi wukamane ufute mughanu wotsu kwange na fure adji nzintu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbile djukaluse mutsanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Va temu eni mwa dighuki di batu, bamarughe oyi tsingule Djesu adimavyoghe: ave batu bamosi ba Ngalile, bamavaghulilaange paghu ombu Nzambi, Pilate akerume batu bandi ubaboke vane, mu usobene malungu mowu na ama paghu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Djesu akebawake rye: «Dwitasi yiri, bise Ngalile beni abamaboku nane, bamabe bavayitsi ba mabi bavyoghulile bise Ngalile botsu? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Nesi, payi dwitasi nane, dumakedunze. Nyidulubusi yiri, payi dughakaluse mutsanu, dufu nane djowu. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Ka dighumi na yinane (18) yi batu abamaviku na ndaghu ndeki adjimarakughe o Siluwé, batu beni bamabe bavyoghulile bise Serusaleme djotsu uvaghe mabi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Nesi, nyidulubusi: payi dughakaluse mitsanu myenu, dufu nane djowu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji mwiri awughéburi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Djesu akebabukile nongu édjidji rye: «Umabe mutu amabe na mumange wuvaru o nungi andi. Akewende yilumbu mu uronde uyéboole mimange, tumbe misamabe. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Mbana, amavose na musatsi nungi rye: “Labati, bilime bike biryeru, nyiruyingi muyidokule mimange mu mumange éwuwu ngedili ne wumosi. Uwangi, wivayi fuyi mwenzili.” <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Tumbe musalitsi akemuwaghule: “Fumu, lewusile yilime ayiyi, ngaghufutse byari byotsu na nyusobene butambe bweni na bu dibumbu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Tangudji, wubure yilime ayiruyi. Payi wughabure, tukewuwaange.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dubelusu du mughetu yibomfi mu yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Mu yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife, Djesu amalonzaange musamu wu Nzambi o ghari ndaghu wowu dusambu. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Vane, vamabe mughetu wumaveghu bubomfi na yinyuni yibi mu dighumi na yinane (18) yi bilime. Amabelaange ngodju djimabe djimughorighe, asamabwérungulaange usimbughe. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Na Djesu emulabi, akemunengile, akemutsingule rye: «Mame, bubomfi bwaghu bumaghusulu.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Akemusakighe makake. Vane-vane, nzime djikesungeme na akedodise Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Tumbe yivunde yi ndaghu eni dusambu akenyoghe, mumbari Djesu amabeluse mutu mu yilumbu yowu yuvume. Akevose na yinombu rye: «Vadji bilumbu bisyamunu byusalile, kaboghu rughenganu bilumbu byébine mu yibelusu. Payi yilumbu yuvume tsatsabi, duyabwérughaange.» <verse eid="LUK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Fumu anomuwulu, akemuwaghule: «Bapende nane djenu! Mu yilumbu yuvume, vagha mutu va ghari enu enyanguli ngombi vo buru andi mu umubeghe oghunu mambe mu yilumbu yeni? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Mughetu éwuwu, mwane Aberaame awu Dyabu amatsoyise mu dighumi na yinane (18) yi bilime mbé aghapatulu va makake mandi mu yilumbu yuvume?»<verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Djesu na evosi nane, bambeni bandi bakebase na yisoni. Yinombu yotsu yikesaghaange dibandu mambu amaboti maneni ame Djesu amadughusungu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji tsangu gheyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mrk 4.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Djesu akebwévose: «Bukaghe bu Nzambi na yi bubaghunu? Na yime yi nyububaghusunu? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Bubaghunu na tsangu gheyi mutu eyekuke mu nungi andi. Ave djibendili, djipalisi mwiri wuneni wuvu na matayi na batsoli beyirunge muve mowu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji yifunise</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13.33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Djesu akebwele uvose rye: «Na yi nyubaghusunu Bukaghe bu Nzambi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Bubaghunu na yifunise ayi mughetu ebongi, akesobene mu ditingi di maghumi mabedji na byetsu biranu bi fufu mu ufunise pate-mape djotsu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mune ndaghu awubandene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Ave Djesu amabile mu nzile mu wende o Serusaleme, akenesikemange mu misyengi na mu mimbu mu yenelongaange musamu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Ave amenewendilaange, mutu wumosi akemuwivule bwena «Fumu, yike bu mwa pesu batu aboghobulu?» Djesu akebawaghule: <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>«Vovenanu mu ukote, va mune ndaghu awubandene. Mumbari nyidutsinguli, bapwele boronde ukote, tumbe baghorungule.<verse eid="LUK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Ave Fumu ndaghu orelimine, mudibighe mune ndaghu, djenu adube o dulombili, dudukise mu yabutsu novose rye: “Fumu tudibulili.” Oduwaghule rye: “Ngedjabi awudwiruyisini!” <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Mbana dumutsingule rye: “Djetu tumadji na tumanu va mosi naghu, na wumenelonzaange musamu mu manzile ma misyengi myetu.” <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Obwébawaghule rye: “Ngédjabi odwiruyisini. Ndundyanu, ghusughanu vane djenu botsu bavayitsi ba mabi!” <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Dulile na dughénighe minu ave dulabile Aberaame, Yisaake, Sakobe na babiyitsi botsu o Bukaghe bu Nzambi, mbana djenu dubwaghu o dulombili! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Batu borusenaange tandu na bande, o wisi epalili, no wisi eputumini. Botsane va mosi va mulambu o Bukaghe bu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Kaboghu,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 13:30">Ababetsi o wusu, bovinge o nzime.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 13:30">Ababetsi nzime, bovinge o wusu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu elilili mu Serusaleme</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Va djulu vane, baFarisi bamarughe mu uyilubuse Djesu rye: «Rambughe na wusughe vave, mumbari Yirode erondi ughuboke.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Wendanu, yetsingulanu yitsalele yéyine: “Nyisanzi bayisi, na nyibelusi bibedu na muni na mughese, mu yilumbu ayimuryeru nyumane yisalu.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Tumbe, ubongile na muni, mughese na mune-mosi nyuyenewende, mumbari digha diwelimine yiri mubiyitsi akefwile yari yisusu patsi o Serusaleme.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>Serusaleme, djenu bise Serusaleme, dwiboki babiyitsi na dwitindi mamani ombu bobésindughu ombu wenu. Kumbu kweni mbé nyironde udughukighe mu dughumbe nane koku eghukiyili noghumbe baane bandi otsi mapapi mandi, tumbe dusamagharu. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Kaboghu, ndaghu enu djusyale mududu. Tumbe dughobwéndabe tena duvose yiri “Nzambi apuyili myule ombu djandi oyiruyili mu dine di Fumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Ser 22.5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Nim 118.26</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebelusi yibedu yi matindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Mu yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife, Djesu amakote o ndaghu yivunde yimosi yi baFarisi mu uyédji nandi. Botsu vane bamabe liyiyi mu ulabe adi Djesu ovaghe. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Vane, vamabe mutu amabe na matindi. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Djesu amabande uvose na akewivule milonzi mi mighaghe na baFarisi: «Divu diwelimine mu mughaghe Moyise, nine vo nesi, ubeluse mutu mu yilumbu yuvume?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Basamamuwaghule, bakebe «swii». Kaboghu Djesu akeghelughe nobembe yibedu, akemubeluse mbana akemutsingule yiri yenewende o ndaghu andi. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Mbana akeghelughe ombu bobamamutsunaange, amabawivule: «Anyi va ghari enu, yike mwane andi vo ngombi andi ebonduyi o ghari yidune yilumbu yuvume, aghomupalise?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Na djowu basamarungule umuwaghule.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu elonzi mu dyambu dyukesunze na yisaghumunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Anolabe yiri botsu bamanengulu o mulambu, bamasolaange bitsighe biteghe bi bundumbe, amavose nongu édjidji: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Yike mutu ewunengili o mulambu diwele, wuyatsutsile uyétsane o yitsighe yiteghe. Tangudji, va ghari botsu abamanengulu vakirughe mutu awu wuvyoghe dighobe, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>na omadunengile djenu botsu babedji, yike eruyi mu wutsingule rye: “Muvyosi va yitsighe yaghu!” Ghureleme na yisonyi mu wende o yitsighe ayisuke o nzime. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Nesi, payi unengulu, léwende o yitsighe ayinzime. Mbana omadunengile, ave okotile, oghutsingule rye: “Mbatsi ami, rughe va yitsighe ayi bwedji wunu wusu.” Avane, wube na dighobe va ghari botsu abavu vane. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Nine,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 14:11">Wotsu oyikerutsule, osundusu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 14:11">Wotsu oyikesunduse, orutsulu.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Djesu amamwévose na awu amamunengile: «Payi wiveyi mulambu wu mwangulu vo wu tsisighe, uyanengile bambatsi baghu, baane ba ngudji baghu, biburu byaghu vo bisine abibambene naghu. Yike wivayi nane, djowu wandi borungule uwunengile na uwughabusile diboti adiwumabavaghe. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Nesi, payi wiveyi mulambu, nengile bidjaghe, bibomfi, bimbolutu na bidunge. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Yike wivayi nane, wulabe nzangu mba ngenze, batu bebane baghorungule uwughabusile. Byonyi byuwughabusulu vo Nzambi orambusile bo basungeme o dufu.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji bobenengulu o mulambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Mu dyoni, mutu mosi amabe va tavule amavosile Djesu rye: «Ubwedji ombu mutu owudji mulambu o Bukaghe bu Nzambi!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Djesu amamuwaghule na nongu édjidji rye: «Vamabe yilumbu, mutu wumosi amavaghe mulambu wuneni. Akenengile batu bapwele. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Diweru dyudji dinotole, akesindighe musatsi andi uyenengile bo mbé boyidji: “Tsyérughyanu, byotsu bimakunzeme!” <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Tumbe botsu abane, bamavonde kokolu mumbari bamabe na bibinde. Awuteghe akemutsingule rye: “Nyitsisumbe nungi, nyileyedjilabe. Wuyanzyembe, kokolu tsyaghu.” <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Wumosi akevose rye: “Nyibenodile dighumi di ngombi, nyileyetsi wétsighe, tandi.” <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Wumosi wandi akemwévose: “Menu nyibonowele mughatsi ami, kaboghu ngodile temu.” <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Vo musatsi amaghabuyile ombu yivunde yandi, amamutsingule bibinde byotsu bamamuveghe. Fumu ndaghu amanyoghe kabu na amavose na musatsi rye: Lenge! Wende mu mbure tsi mughungi na mu mimbambe mi musyengi na beghe bidjaghe, bibomfi, bidunge na bimbolutu! <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Mu mwa pesu temu, musatsi amarughe na amamutsingule rye: “Fumu, nyimavaghe nane wutsinzingulile, tumbe vakisyale mambure.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Kaboghu fumu andi akemutsingule rye: “Wende mu manzile, mu mighule bivaghe, ghome batu yi borughe mumba ndaghu ami djikebase. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Mbana nyighutsinguli, vagha mutu ne wumosi mu bo bamarele unengulu, baghobwémimbe mulambu éwuwu!”»<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adi mutu ovaghe mube mudukitsi Djesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Binombu bineni bimawenda konge na Djesu. Amaghelughe nzime na amabitsingule rye: <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>«Payi mutu erondi unduke, aletonde pwele wuvyolile uronde tadji andi, ngudji andi, mughatsi andi, baane bandi, baane ba ngudji bandi, babaale vo baghetu, ne monyu andi. Patsi nane, aghorunguse ube mudukitsi ami. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Na wotsu aghonangule kurusu andi mu unduke, aghobe mudukitsi ami. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Payi mutu ane ditase dyurunge ndaghu ndeki, eletsane mu djabe durangu du mbongu na bisalulu nolabe yiri orungule umane. <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Ave obandile usale yibughe payi aghamwérunguse udjimane, bobamamulabe ubande urunge, bomusyembaange, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>novose rye: “Mutu éwuwu amabande urunge ndaghu na aghamwédjimanisile!”»<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Na Djesu akebwévose rye: «Kaghe nyi, payi otoghe divite na kaghe susu, aghéletsane mu kelule yiri na dighumi di tosini baghore obenze uyébengusunu oyiruyi mu yimutoyise na maghumi mabedji ma tosini baghore? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Payi aghaane mangolu mawelimine, otinde bilumbi mu uvonde duvotsu pa kaghe eni akivale! <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Kaboghu munongu mosi, wotsu aghorungule usile maboti mandi motsu, agha awelimine ube mudukitsi ami.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>Djesu akebwévose rye: «Musayi yime yiboti, tumbe payi musayi wumasambughe, yike yi yubwémughabusile mughangu? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Asane yisalu mu butambe vo o dibumbu, yike ubwaghu o dulombili. Wotsu avu na matudji limbaa, awulu!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji yindombu ayimatsyemughe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Babolitsi ba lepu na bavayitsi ba mabi bamabambene na Djesu mu uyéwulu malongi mandi. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>BaFarisi na Milonzi mi mighaghe bamavosaange ba fundu rye: «Mutu éwuwu akegharungu udji va mosi na bango mabi!»<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Tumbe, Djesu akebabukile nongu édjidji rye: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«Anyi va ghari enu, avu na kame bindombu, na akitsyemuse yimosi, aghesili maghumi-dufu na yifu (99) yi bindombu mu kumu, mu uyenerombe ayitsitsyemughe tena vo oyilabile? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Ave eyilabili, ebasi na nzangu, eyinanguli no yisunze va masambeke. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Anotole o ndaghu andi, akenengili bambatsi bandi na botsu ababambene nandi novose rye: “Rughanu, tusayanu: yindombu yami ayi mbé yimatsyemughe, yimalabene.” <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Divu munongu mosi o djulu, ave muvayitsi mabi wumosi ekaluyili mutsanu, nzangu neni djibi o djulu uvyoghulile adji maghumi-dufu na yifu (99) yi batu basungeme abasane nzale ukalughe mutsanu.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji doli adumatsyemughe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>Djesu amamwébabukile nongu: «Payi mughetu ane dighumi di doli, yike etsyemusi dumosi, yi ovaghe? Obanze paghe, oghombule ndaghu, odurombe yari na yari tena odulabe. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Yike edulabi, enengili bambatsi bandi ababambene nandi nobatsingule rye: “Rughanu, tusayanu, doli dwami adu mbé dumatsyemughe, nyimadulabe.” <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Munongu wumosi nyidutsinguli bwena: nzangu neni djibi ombu byanze bi Nzambi ave muvayitsi wumosi wu mabi ekaluyili mutsanu.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji baane babedji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Djesu amamwébabukile nongu mosi rye: «Vamabe dibaale dimabe na baane babedji ba babaale, <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Awu ngebi amavose na tadji andi rye: “Tate, peyi dyami dikabu di disyale.” Tadji akebaghabile maboti mandi. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Bilumbu binovyoghe, ngebi akesumbise byandi byotsu, akenewende na mbongu tsyandi o malongu ma vale. Aghune, akenyambesene mbongu tsyandi tsyotsu mu monyu dimbunge. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Anonyambesene byotsu, dungosu du nzale dukabe o bulongu bweni na akebande ulabe maghughe na asamamwébe na ayi udji. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Akewende oyevonde dibaale di mwise bulongu bweni bisalu. Tumbe dibaale dyeni, akemutinde o masaku o wumabe yivange yandi yi bangulu mu ubakelisaange. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Djandi amarondaange ne udji bipupu bi bighudji bamaveghaange bangulu, tumbe vasamabe mutu amamugharusu. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Amabande urangimine na amavose rye: “Basatsi ba tate bedji bighudji usyalulu, mbana menu wunu utopulu nyi topulu na nzale. <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Nyughabughe ombu tate na nyumutsingule rye Tate, nyimavaghe disumu va wusu Nzambi na va wusu awu. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Nyisa nyiwelimine wunengulu mwane aghu, tumbe mbongi na nane musalitsi aghu.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Amareleme noghabughe ombu tadji andi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Tadji andi anomulabile, ne nane mbé akivale, akebase na yingebe. Akewende mbangu na nzangu mu uyémubumbe mu kingu. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Vane-vane, mwane akevose rye: “Tate, nyimavaghe disumu va wusu Nzambi na va wusu aghu. Nyisa nyiwelimine unengulu mwane aghu.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Tumbe tadji akevose na basatsi bandi rye: “Lenganu nobeghe bikutu bi dufunu, mudwisyanu, muvakighyanu moru nomudwise bapondu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Beghanu ngombi adjivonge, djibokyanu, lambanu, tudjanu na tusayanu, <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>mumbari mwane ami wuwu mbé amafu, amaghabughe monyu; mbé amatsyemughe, amalabene.” Bakebande usaghe.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>Yivunde amabe o manungi. Ave amaghabuyile, anotole bebeli na ndaghu, amawulu nduku bisighu na miyinu. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Amanengile musatsi wumosi, amamuwivule dyambu adivyoyi. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Musatsi eni amamuwaghule rye: “Mwane ngudji aghu amaghabughe. Tadji aghu atsirume uboke ngombi djivonge, mumbari ngebi awu atsighabughe polu.” <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Yivunde akebase na kabu, akebuse ukote o ndaghu. Tadji akepale, akeyemulende akekote. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Tumbe yivunde akewaghule tadji andi rye: “Labati, pwele bilime nyighusalili, ngekikuli ne dirume dyaghu dimosi. Ukapeghaange ne mwa tabe ‘vyaa’ nyikesaghe na bambatsi bami. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Tumbe mwane awu aghabuyilaange, djandi omadji maboti maghu na bimbembu, tsya djandi wumabokile ngombi adjivonge!” <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Tadji akemuwaghule: “Aa! Ndewandi mwane ami, wudji nami temu djotsu, byotsu abivu nami, abyaghu wandi. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Kaboghu diwelimine yiri tudjanu nosaghe va mosi, mumbari mwane ngudji aghu:</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 15:32">Awu mbé amafu, amaghabughe monyu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 15:32">Awu mbé amatsyemughe, amalabene.”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji yivunde yi basatsi ayivu na malubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Djesu etsinguli badukitsi bandi rye: «Yisine yimosi amabe na musatsi wumabe yivunde yi basatsi botsu. Batu bakemufunde bwena: “Musatsi aghu ebungi nonyambesene maboti maghu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Fumu maboti akenengile musatsi eni, akemuwivule yiri: “Yi nyiwulu bévosili mu ndedju? Nzinguli nane wikelisili maboti mami mumbari wughobwémakelise.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Musatsi eni, akekéwivulaange: “Yivunde yami aghébwéronde yiri ngakelise maboti mandi. Yike tsyeni nyuvayile? Nyivayi manungi, ngaane mangolu; nyibi mu uvonde, nyube na yisoni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Kaboghu nyimadjabe adi nyikivaghe ave nyikighusululu mu bisalu, mu udilu na batu nami mu mandaghu mowu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Musatsi eni amanengile mutu-mutu omabe na mughanu. Akewivule awuteghe: “Kweni winwani Fumu ami?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Djandi akemuwake rye: “Kame mireghe mi matsi.” Musatsi akemutsingule: “La mughande, lenge utsane na rende maghumi maranu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Akebwéwivule wumosi wandi: “Ka ndedju, kweni winwani?” Dibaale dyeni akemuwake: “Kame saku tsi bighudji.” Musatsi akemutsingule: “La mughande, rende maghumi-dunana (80).” <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Kaboghu, fumu maboti akesingisile musatsi eni yifutsi mu dyele adi djandi amadile. Labatyanu nane batu ba bulongu bwébubu babile na mele maneni, wuvyoghulile ne baane ba yidjalale.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutu aghorungule usalile fumu bedji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Djesu akebwese rye: «Nyidutsinguli, salisanu busine bwenu na mbongu tsi mfurulu, mu udile bambatsi, mumbari ave busukile, dudilu mu mandaghu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Odjivu awelimine udughusu mambu amagheyi na musighe, awelimine wandi udughusu amaneni. Djandi oyifuri vo udyonge mu mambu magheyi, ofure na udyonge wandi mu mambu amaneni. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Payi dusamabe dusigheme mu busine bu mfurulu, anyi oduveghe busine abu ngenze? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Na payi dusamabe dusungeme mu maboti ma ngane, anyi oduveghe maboti amajenu beni?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>Vagha mutu orungule usalile fumu bedji: ovine wumosi, akeronde wune, vo oghobise wumosi na akelenze wune. Kaboghu, dughorungule usalile Nzambi nosalile mbongu va mosi.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esyembi baFarisi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mrk 10.11-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>BaFarisi, na nzale mbongu, banowulu motsu ame Djesu amavosaange, bakemupedjingi. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Djesu akebatsingule rye: «Djenu dudji batu békelase yiri basungeme va wusu batu nenu, tumbe Nzambi edjabi mirime myenu. Motsu, ame bédodisi va misu ma batu, madji nzoruru va wusu Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>Mughaghe Moyise na mughande babiyitsi mimabe vane tena San-Batise. Ubandile va temu San-Batise, musamu wuboti wu Bukaghe bu Nzambi wisamunu. Mutu-mutu oghaghene mu uyékote wune. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Djulu na butambe byurungule utsyemughe mbangu-mbangu, tumbe ne yirendu yimosi mu mughaghe yighorungule utsyemughe.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>Dibaale dyotsu adisanzi mughatsi andi na eweli wususu, etubi bukali. Mbana, wotsu eweli mughetu wusanzu na mulumi andi, djawandi etubi bukali.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji yisine na Lasare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>«Vamabe yisine yimadwaraange bikutu bi dufunu duneni. Bilumbu bi monyu andi wotsu, amabangaange mu nzangu, mumbari amabe na busine buvyoghulile. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Vamabe wandi yidjaghe dine dyandi Lasare, amabe na mapure. Batu bakimusunzaange kale yilumbu va mune ndaghu yisine yeni. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Lasare, amarondaange ubole nodji bikukuku abimabondughaange va tavule yisine. Tumbe bamondi bamayivendaange mapure mandi. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Mwa yilumbu, yidjaghe akefu, akebeghu na byanze va tulu Aberaame. Yisine wandi akefu, bakemutsighe. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Aghune bulungi bu mudji, yisine amatsoghaange pwele. O vale, amabilile Lasare va tulu Aberaame. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Wune disimu dimosi, yisine akeghamughe rye: “Tate ami Aberaame, nda ngebe. Sindighe Lasare aputiyi kodu mulembu andi mu mambe na andekisi diberi va dulimi, mumbari ngorungule wuwarile ditsoghe adidi o ghari mudji éwuwu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Tumbe Aberaame akemuwaghule rye: “Mwane ami, rangimine monyu aghu, wumabe mu maboti na maboti, mbana Lasare djandi amabe mu maghughe. Tumbe aghunu, Lasare yike wubembughu, ebembughu, mbana ndedju, temu awumaghughe djimatole. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Va ghari djetu nenu vadji mbengi neni, mumbari djenu aduvu wune, dughorungule usabughe awutuvu. Djetu wandi, tughorungule wusabughe awuduvu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Yisine akemutsingule bwena: “Tate Aberaame kokolu nyighulendi, kaboghu sindighe Lasare o ndaghu tadji ami. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Mumbari nyine baane ba ngudji baranu ba babaale. Lasare awendi mu uyébalubuse yiri bakérughe djowu wandi o mbure adjidji dji maghughe.” <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Aberaame akemuwaghule rye: “Baane ba ngudji baghu bane musamu wu Moyise na awu babiyitsi awibalubusi, kaboghu bawughulu nowutsiyise!” <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Yisine akemuwake rye: “Nesi tate Aberaame tsinane. Mutu awu mbé wumafu, awendi ombu wowu, ayebatsingule, tangudji bokalughe mutsanu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Aberaame akemutsingule djawandi rye: “Payi djowu baghagharu uwulu mambu ma Moyise na ma babiyitsi, baghogharu uwulu wandi musamu ne ame djandi omarambughe o dufu.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu elonzi mu dyambu di disumu na dutandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">18.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mrk 9.42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Djesu amatsingule badukitsi bandi rye: «Vobangaange mambu amorobisaange batu uvaghe mabi. Kamune maghughe-ma, ombu mutu owurombise bambatsi uvaghe mabi! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Mutu eni, yike erombisi ne ngebi mosi uvaghe mabi, mbé dyuwelimine mu djandi bakemutunge dimani dineni mu kingu nomubwaghe o mubu. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Kebenanu, payi mwane tadji aghu evayi dibi, mughabusi mu nzile. Na yike edinyongi, mutandi. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Payi eghuvayili dibi yisambwali yi kumbu mu yilumbu, na yikéghabuyi yisambwali yi kumbu wandi mu uyuvonde kokolu, mutandi.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yitu mu Nzambi nane tsangu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:19-20">Mat 17.19-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Bilumbi bimatsingule Fumu rye: «Warise yitu yetu mu Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Fumu akewaghule: «Payi yitu yenu yibaghunu na tsangu tsigheyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tsangu tsigheyi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">milunde miburi o ghari nungi yivaru yineni. </char></note>, durungule urume mwiri éwuwu yiri “kerubule, yekevare o mubu”, na wududedile.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musatsi na yisalu yandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>«Anyi, va ghari enu avu na musatsi, wivayi manungi vo wukelise bindombu, ave djandi eruyili o manungi, mu temu eni, akemutsingule rye: “Rughe, tsane na djange”? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Vyaaghe, dumutsingule yiri: “Léndambile bighudji, mbana yevinze bikutu, yinzunzile bighudji ngadji, nganu. Avane wusu, ndewandi wudji na wunu.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Dusingisile musatsi mumbari atsisale byotsu abidutsimurume? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Munongu mosi nenu. Ave dwidughusulu motsu ame bédurumi, vosanu rye: “Djetu, tudji basatsi abaghékelisi dusingusulu, mumbari twidughusu yike yisalu ayimaturumu.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebelusi dighumi di bibedu bi nyaambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Ave Djesu amawendilaange o Serusaleme, amavyolaange va ndilu Samari na Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Ave amatolile va dimbu dimosi, dighumi di bibedu bi nyámbi dimamubengusunu tumbe, basamabambene nandi. <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Na bibedu byeni bikeghamughe rye: «Djesu, Fumu, tulabi wandi yingebe!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Ave Djesu amabalabile, akebatsingule rye: «Wendanu, yekelasanu menu ombu bavaghulitsi ba paghu.» Ave bamayene wendilaange, mu nzile bamabelughe. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Wumosi va ghari owu, anolabe bwena amabelughe, akeghabusile mu nzile adji amavyole, akenedodisaange Nzambi na mighamu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Akeghudume va wusu Djesu, mbami na tsi, na akemughabusile diboti. Mutu eni amabe mwise Samari. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Djesu akemuwivule: «Dighumi dyotsu ditsibelusu. Ka yifu yi bane yike wuka? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Mu djowu botsu, yike mweni éwuwu awutsidjabe uyighabusile diboti ombu Nzambi?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Mbanane Djesu akemutsingule rye: «Releme, wendange, yitu yaghu yimaghughobule.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bilimbe bi durughulu du Bukaghe bu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">24.37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>BaFarisi bakewivule Djesu rye: «Temu yi, Nzambi obandile ulase bukaghe bwandi va ghari mukute andi?» Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Bukaghe bu Nzambi bughorughe nane yime ayulabene na misu. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Baghovose bwena: “Budji vave vo budji wuna”. Tumbe djabanu yiri na muni, Bukaghe bu Nzambi bumakote mu mirime myenu.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yilumbu ayi Mwane Mutu oruyile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Mbana Djesu aketsingule badukitsi bandi rye: «Mu bilumbu abyurughe, dube na nzale ulabe ne yilumbu yimosi yi Mwane Mutu, tumbe ne vane, dughoyilabe. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Ave batu bodutsingulilaange rye: “Adji vave!” Vo: “Adji wuna!” Duyabawulu, duyabaduke. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Kaboghu, yilumbu ayi Mwane Mutu oruyile, yube nane yivevedi yi kaki. Osundile ulabene, na yidjalale yandi yubase djulu djotsu kodu na kodu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Tumbe, diwelimine yiri Mwane Mutu oletsoghusu pwele, na obusu na batu ba temu édjidji. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Adimalabene mu temu Nowe, dyumwébe munongu mosi mu yilumbu ayi Mwane Mutu oruyile. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Batu bamadjangaange, bamanwangaange, bamawelesenaange na bamawetsaange baane bowu tena yilumbu ayi Nowe amakotile mu bwatu buneni. Mvule mutsoghu djikenoghe, nidu djineni djikerughe na botsu abamasyale bakefu. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Yilumbu yi durughulu du Mwane Mutu, yumwébe munongu mosi nane va temu Lote mwise Sodome. Batu bamadjangaange na bamanwangaange; bamasumbaange na bamasumbisaange; bamavaraange na bamarungisaange. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Tumbe yilumbu ayi Lote amaghusuyile musyengi Sodome, Nzambi akenoyise mvule maghaghele ma mudji na batu botsu bakefu. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Dyoni dyube munongu mosi mu yilumbu ayi Mwane Mutu olabenine.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Mu temu eni, diwelimine yiri mutu wotsu owube o djulu ndaghu andi, ayasundughe mu uyébonge bime byandi o ghari ndaghu. Munongu mosi ombu mutu owube o manungi, kilikingi ayaghabughe o dimbu. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Rangiminanu mughatsi Lote! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Wotsu owuronde ughaghe monyu andi, owuvinde; tumbe owughutsyemuse, owudile. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Nyidutsinguli, mukolu eni, batu babedji bobe va tangi: wumosi obongu, awune osilu. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Baghetu babedji borokaange va mosi, wumosi obongu, awune osilu. [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Babaale babedji abobe o ghari nungi, wumosi obongu, awune osilu.]» <verse eid="LUK 17:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Badukitsi bakewivule Djesu rye: «Fumu, dyoni mbure yi dyuvyoyile?» Djesu akebawaghule rye:</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 17:37">«Ave yibindi yube,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 17:37">avane banyunge wandi boghukemine<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 39:30">Sob 39.30</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji mukwili na nzonzi djibive</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Djesu amababukile nongu mu ubalase bwena bosambilaange na yikanane na baghodede. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Akebatsingule rye: «Vamabe nzonzi va musyengi, asamadumange Nzambi na asamaghobisaange mutu wotsu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Mune musyengi eni, wumabe mukwili wumawendaange kadi yilumbu ombu nzonzi eni mu uyemutsotsaange rye: “Tabulili bunzonzi va ghari menu na bavinitsi bami.” <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Vane kale, amalebusaange. Anokelonge, amavose rye: “Nénane ngédumi Nzambi na ngeghobisi mutu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>mu yiswebiri yi mukwili ewune, nyumutabulile bunzonzi mumbari akébwéyikomise muru.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Fumu akebwévose rye: «Ghulwatyanu adi nzonzi djibive amavose! <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Tambusu na Nzambi, ovayile bunzonzi mu batu bandi abemulendi mu dusambu nyangu na mukolu! Tsiri nane? Ngenze, aghotsikedene mu ubawamuse. <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Menu, nyidutsinguli, Nzambi obatabulile bunzonzi mbangu-mbangu. Tumbe ave Mwane Mutu oruyile, oyirasunu mwa dikabu di batu bavu na yitu va butambe?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji muFarisi na mubolitsi lepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Djesu akemwébuke nongu ombu batu abekélabe bwena basungeme na belenzi basusu, akevose rye: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Babaale babedji bamakote o ghari ndaghu Nzambi mu uyésambile. Wumosi amabe muFarisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">muFarisi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yivunde yi ndaghu Nzambi, awumaghobisange mughaghe Moyise na yikanene.</char></note>, awune mubolitsi lepu. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>MuFarisi, ave amasambililaange diteli, akebwaghaange mitsoki rye: “Tate Nzambi, nyiwughabusili diboti mumbari ngaa nane batu bamosi bavu badayi, bafutsi, bimbembu, vo nane mubolitsi éwuwu wu lepu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Mu uwughobise, nyiwarili nzale nyongu bedji mu tsone, nyiwuveyingi yimosi mu dighumi yi maboti mami motsu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Kaboghu mubolitsi lepu anobe diteli, va mughule, asamarungusaange ne unangule misu na djulu, tumbe akedumange tulu andi na akevosaange rye: “Tate Nzambi ndabi ngebe muvayitsi mabi nane menu.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Djesu akemwévose rye: «Nine, nyidutsinguli, yotsu mubolitsi lepu eghabuyili o ndaghu andi, Nzambi amamutande nomusungighe, wuvenguse muFarisi.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 18:14">Wotsu oyikerutsule, Nzambi omudyamise.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 18:14">Wotsu okedyamise, orutsulu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu eveyi myule ombu baane ba bangebi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mrk 10.13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Batu wandi bakebeghange baane bakali ombu Djesu mumbari akebasakighaange makake. Badukitsi bandi, banolabe nane, bakenyangilaange batu beni. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Djesu amanengile baane beni va mughule andi na akevose bwena: «Silanu baane urughe ombu ami na duyabaghandise, mumbari Bukaghe bu Nzambi, budji mu batu ababaghunu nowu. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Dingenze nyidutsinguli, wotsu aghodile Bukaghe bu Nzambi nane mwane ngebi, aghokote wune “vyaa”.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisine na Bukaghe bu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mrk 10.17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Yivunde yimosi yi baSwife, yike wivule Djesu rye: «Mulonzi wuboti, tsyeni nyuvayile mu udile monyu mutubu?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Djesu akemuwaghule rye: «Dibandu yi windengilili “Muboti”? Vagha mutu aboti, wuvengutse Nzambi pinze. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Widjabi marume ma Nzambi: “Wuyatube bukali, wuyaboke, wuyadaghe, wuyafurile mutu naghu dyambu. Ghobise tadji na ngudji aghu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ukm 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Det 5.16-20</ref> </char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Yivunde yeni yi baSwife yikewaghule Djesu rye: «Ubongile bungebi bwami, dedi na vave nyikevu yivunde, nyighobisi mambu motsu.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Djesu anomuwulu, akemuwaghule rye: «Vaki dyambu dimosi diwusyali udughusu: byotsu abivu naghu, bisumbisi, ghaabile bidjaghe mbongu na Nzambi owuveghe busine o djulu, mbana rughe, nduki.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Dibaale dyeni, anowulu mambu meni, aketsore manyuru, mumbari amabe yisine yineni. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Djesu, anomulabe yiri amatsore manyuru, akevose rye: «Divure ombu djowu abavu na maboti mapwele mu ukote o Bukaghe bu Nzambi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Nine, disavure ombu tsungu mu uvyoyile va dighole di tsongi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dighole di tsongi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dilute di tsongi.</char></note>; diweru dineni ombu yisine mu ukote mu Bukaghe bu Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Batu abamamuwulu, bamamuwivule rye: «Kaboghu, yike nyi, orungulu ughobulu?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Djesu amabawaghule rye: «Adivu divure ombu batu, dighaa divure ombu Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Pyere akevose rye: «Labati, djetu, tumasile byotsu na tumawuduke.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Dingenze, nyidutsinguli, mutu wotsu, aghorungule usile ndaghu andi, mughatsi na baane bandi, baane ba ngudji bandi na biburu byandi byotsu dibandu Bukaghe bu Nzambi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>yi aghodile bipwele mu temu édjidji, na monyu mutubu mu temu adjiruyi.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu emwébatsingule adi muryeru dufu na durambughulu dwandi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mrk 10.32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Djesu anonengile dighumi na badukitsi bandi babedji (12) va mughule andi, akebatsingule rye: «Wulwanu, o Serusaleme twiwendyanu, aghune motsu moyedughusu, ame babiyitsi bamarende mu dyambu di Mwane Mutu. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Djandi, owakusu va makake ma djowu abaghédjabi Nzambi. Batu beni, bomudese, bomusyenge na bomufute matedji. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Yikebemani wumudimbe na mikase mi batsilu, bomuboke. Mbana, mu yilumbu ayimuryeru, orambughe o dufu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Tumbe badukitsi basamawulu ne dimosi mu mambu ame Djesu amavosaange. Payi basamawulu, mumbari divindughulu dimabasweghu.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebelusi yidunge o musyengi wu Djeriku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mrk 10.46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Djesu anobe bebeli na Seriku, vamabe yidunge yitsane va mughulu nzile yimabe muvondi. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Yidunge yeni anowulu nduku yinombu yi batu bamavyoghaange, amabawivule rye: «Yine yi? Dyambu yi?» <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Batu bakemuwaghule rye: «Djesu mwise Nasarete evyoyi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Na djandi amaghamughe: «Djesu, mwane Davide, ndabi wandi yingebe!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Batu abamavyoghaange va wusu andi, bakemughubisaange: Aa vole! Tumbe yidunge yeni akebwébwelaange ughamughe na mangolu: «Mwane Davide, ndabi wandi yingebe.» <verse eid="LUK 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Djesu, anosikeme, amarume rye: «Mumbeyilyanu.» Yidunge anobambene, Djesu akemuwivule rye: <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>«Yi wirondi ngawuvayile?» Djandi akemuwaghule rye: «Fumu, nyirondi ubwélabe nane va teghe.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Djesu akemutsingule rye: «Tsyélabi! Yitu yaghu yimaghughobule.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Sundila, misu ma yidunge make tyemune, na akeduke Djesu noyeneyitsange Nzambi. Batu botsu na bédilabi, djowandi bakeyitse Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu na Sase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Djesu anokote o musyengi Seriku, akewunaange. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Va musyengi eni, vamabe dibaale, dine dyandi Sase; djandi amabe yivunde yi babolitsi ba lepu na amabe yisine. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Amarondaange ulabe na udjabe Djesu. Abilange aghufi, na yinombu yimabe yivyoghulile, asamarungule umulabe. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Sase, anolabe nane, akerele mbangu o wusu, akemate mu mwiri awumabe vane mughule nzile adji Djesu amavyoyilaange mu umulabe burange. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Ave Djesu amatolile va mbure eni, anonangule misu na djulu, akemulabe na akemutsingule rye: «Sase, lenge nosundughe! Na nyangu, yilatsi mu ndaghu aghu.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Sase anosundughe maswasu, akedile Djesu na nzangu djotsu mu ndaghu andi. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Botsu abamadilabe, bamaningaange novose rye: «Mutu éwuwu amayekote novyose yilatsi o ndaghu muvayitsi mabi nane wune!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Sase anoreleme va wusu Fumu, aketsingule rye: «Fumu, la yasi yi maboti mami, nyuyighabile bidjaghe. Payi nyimadyonge mutu, nyumuvanine kumbu djine.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Djesu akewaghule rye: «Na muni, dughobutsu dumakote o ghari ndaghu édjidji, mumbari djawandi adji muteghule Aberaame. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Mwane Mutu amarughe mu uyirombe noghobule abatsyemughe.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu amabuke nongu dji bidjeti biryeru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Abamabe vane, banowulu mambu meni, Djesu akebwele nongu mosi mumbari mbé ake bebeli na Serusaleme. Na batu beni bamatasaange yiri na mapape, Nzambi orughe mu uyibyatsu kaghe va ghari owu. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Djesu akebatsingule rye: «Dibaale dimosi di mukute awumabe na didume, amawende o bulongu bu vale bakeyémubyatse kaghe bulongu bwandi, mbana mbé oghabusile. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Ne akewende, akenengile dighumi di bidjeti byandi, akewakise kadi mutu dyandi dikabu di mbongu. Akebatsingule rye: “Salisanu mbongu tena nyughabughe.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Bise bulongu bwandi, basamadironde, baketinde batu o nzime kodu mu uyemutsingule rye: “Djetu, tugherondi urumusu na kaghe nane djandi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Dibaale dyeni akebyatsu kaghe o bulongu bweni. Anoghabughe o mulingu andi, akenengile bidjeti byandi abe amawakise mbongu mu bawivule nane bamatsisalisile. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Yidjeti ayiteghe akebambene na akevose rye: “Fumu, wumapeghe yikuru yimosi yi mbongu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yikuru yimosi yi mbongu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fute dji miweli miryeru. </char></note>, va djulu yoni, nyitsidile dighumi di bikuru.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Kaghe eni, akemutsingule rye: “Diboti, wudji musatsi wungenze, wutsiwelemine mu mambu amagheyi, kaboghu nyuwubyatse mu dighumi di misyengi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Yidjeti ayi mubedji yike rughe, akevose rye: “Fumu, wumapeghe yikuru yimosi yi mbongu, va djulu yoni, nyitsidile bikuru biranu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Kaghe akemutsingule rye: “Ndedju, nyuwubyatse mu misyengi miranu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Yidjeti ayine yike rughe novose rye: “Fumu, la yikuru yaghu, nyimayisweghe va disite di tsande. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Nyimabe na ghome aghu, mumbari wudji mutu wurange: wibongi abi ndedju wughésunzi; wifuli abi ndedju wughévari.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Kaghe akemutsingule rye: “Mu posulu ndebeni nyiwusosisi, musatsi mubi nane ndedju! Wumadjabaange yiri nyidji mutu wurange: nyibongi abi nyisamasunze na nyifuli abi nyisamavare. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Wumadjabe nane, mbé wumayesunze mbongu tsyami ombu bakoli, mbana ave mbé nyimaghabuyile, mbé nyimayitsibonge na bapite va djulu?” <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Na aketsingule botsu abamabe vane rye: “Mupatulyanu yikuru ayivu nandi, na yiveyanu ombu djandi awavu na dighumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Batu beni, bamasimine novose rye: “Fumu, ka djandi akane dighumi di bikuru!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Kaghe akebawaghule rye: “Menu nyidutsinguli: mutu wotsu awuvu na yime, bomubwese; tumbe wotsu aghaane yime, bomupatule nesi mwa pesu adjivu nandi. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Tumbe bambeni bami abasamaronde yiri nyike byatsu nane kaghe owu, bambeyilyanu vave na batabulyanu bakingu va wusu ami.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu etoli o Serusaleme</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mrk 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">San 12.12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Djesu anomane uvose, akerele va wusu na akemate o Serusaleme. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Ave amabambeninaange na mimbu ma Betefase na Betani, anobe bebeli na mukongu winengulu «mukongu wu miri mi Olive<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Olive: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bamasalisaange milunde myeni mu ghamange matsi.</char></note>», akesindighe badukitsi bandi babedji na akebatsingule rye: <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>«Wendanu o dimbu adivu va wusu enu. Ave dutolile, durasune mwane yibulu atungu, awuskatsanunu na mutu. Munyangulyanu na mumbeyilyanu wunu. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Payi mutu atsiduwivule rye: “Mumbari yi dwimunyangulili?” Duke muwaghule rye: “Fumu ane nzale woni.”» <verse eid="LUK 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Djowu abasindughu bakewende, na bakerasunu byotsu nane Djesu amabatsingulile. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Ave bamanyangulilaange mwane yibulu yeni, ba fumu, bakebawivule rye: «Dibandu yi dwinyangulili mwane yibulu?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Bakebawaghule rye: «Fumu ane nzale woni.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Banobeghe yibulu yeni ombu Djesu, bakene walange bikutu byowu va djulu yibulu, na bakematise Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Ave Djesu amayene wendilaange, mu nzile djotsu, batu bakeyene walange bikutu byowu. <verse eid="LUK 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Mu temu eni Djesu amabe bebeli na ukote o Serusaleme. Amavindeminange adu mukongu miri mi baOlive, binombu bi batu na badukitsi bandi, mu nzangu adjimavyoghulile mu djowu, bakesaghange nododise Nzambi na mighamu mineni. Bamasaghaange, dibandu bimaghe bineni abi djowu bamalabe. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Mu duyitsu dwowu, bakevosange rye: «Nzambi aveyi myule ombu kaghe adjiruyi mu dine di Fumu! Duvotsu o djulu na bundumbe ombu Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Nim 118.26</ref></char></note>!»<figure style="fig" alt="Djesu etoli o Serusaleme" file="WA03895b.tif" size="col" loc="19.32-38" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="19.38"/><verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Yinombu yi baFarisi yimabe mukonge, baketsingule Djesu rye: «Mulonzi, votse badukitsi baghu!» <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Djesu akebawake rye: «Nyidutsinguli, payi djowu batsivole, mamani moghamughe mu uyitse Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu elili mu dyambu di Serusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Djesu na ebambini na musyengi Serusaleme, na ewulabilili, akelile. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>Na akevose rye: «Serusaleme, nyinyongi mu ndedju, wusamadjabe nane mbé wumadilile duvotsu mu yilumbu yéyine, aa temu dji mavyoghe na dyoni dimawusweghu. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Kaboghu, mu bilumbu abyurughe, bambeni baghu borungise bivaghe mu mighule myaghu, bowutsyenge na bowubandesene yari na yari. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Bowunighe ndedju Serusaleme na batu baghu botsu. Mu ndedju, baghowusile ne dimani dimosi va djulu disusu, mumbari wusamakelule temu adji Nzambi mbé amawuwamusile.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu esanzi bakoli o ndaghu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mrk 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">San 2.13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Djesu anokote o ghari yivaghe yi ndaghu Nzambi, akesanze bakoli. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Akebatsingule rye: «Bisonu bi Nzambi bivosi rye: Ndaghu ami djube ndaghu dusambu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Ser 7.11</ref></char></note>. Tumbe djenu dumadjikaluse yike yiswemunu yi bikongu.» <verse eid="LUK 19:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Bilumbu byotsu, Djesu akelonzaange va dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi. Bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, milonzi mi mighaghe na bivunde abimarumisaange mikute bakerombange tonu djubokile Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Tumbe, basamadile tonu, mumbari mukute wotsu wumabe limbaa, mu uwulu malongi mandi.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu, anyi atsiwuveghe musughe awune?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mrk 11.27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Mwa yilumbu, Djesu amalonzaange batu, akebatsingulaange musamu wuboti va dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi. Bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, milonzi mi mighaghe na bivunde bi baSwife bimosi bakebarasune vane. <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Bivunde byeni bakemuwivule rye: «Awuni widilile musughe mu udughusu mambu mémane? Tutsinguli, anyi amawuveghe musughe ewune?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Menu wandi nyuduwivule yivu: <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Anyi amasindighe San nomuveghe musughe wu ubatise batu? Amasindughu na Nzambi vo na batu?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Batu beni, bakevosange va ghari djobeni rye: «Yike twisingi yiri Nzambi amamurume, djandi otuwivule rye: “Ka mumba yi dusamasingile ame San amavose?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Yike twimuwaghuli yiri musughe eni ombu batu wiruyili, mukute wotsu wututinde mamani mu utuboke, mumbari batu beni bédjabi yiri San amabe mubiyitsi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Batu beni, bakewaghule Djesu rye: «Djetu, tughedjabi anyi amamuveghe musughe mu ubatise batu.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Na Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Menu wandi, ngodutsingule mu musughe nyi nyimavayili.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji bisyele bibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mrk 12.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Djesu anomane uvose, akemwébukile mukute nongu rye: «Dibaale amavare nungi dji miri mi vinye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nungi dji miri mi vinye: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nungi ane bivale bi kumu amiburi milunde mu vayile dingibe dibenge.</char></note>, akedjisile va makake ma bisyele mu udjikelise, na amawende mu mulingu yitsingu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Temu dighumbe djinotole, fumu nungi akesindighe musatsi andi wumosi ombu bisyele abimasyale na nungi, Bakemuveghe dyandi dikabu di milunde mi vinye. Tumbe bisyele byeni bakedimbe musatsi eni kube na bakemughabuse myowu pavele. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Fumu nungi, akesindighe awu mubedji, bisyele byeni bakedimbe wune wandi kube, bakemusyenge na bakemughabuse myowu na myowu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Akebwésindighe awu mutatu, awune wandi, bakemutsungule na bakemusyanze. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Fumu nungi akekewivule: “Tsyeni ngavale? Nyusindighe mwane ami murime, tangudji bomughobise.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Tumbe ave bisyele byeni bamalabile mwane andi, baketsingusunaange rye: “Lanu mungo disyale! Tumubokyanu, tuke byalile nungi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Bisyele, bakemughange, bakemupalise o ghari nungi na bakemuboke.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Djesu akebawivule rye: «Mu dyoni, yike yi fumu nungi obavaghe? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Djandi, orughe na oboke bisyele byeni bine, na owakise nungi andi va makake ma bisyele bisusu.» Batu banowulu nane, bakemuwake rye: «Tsatsabi, dighorungule ube nane!»<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Djesu anobaghengile, akebawivule rye: «Divindughulu di Bisonu bi Nzambi, tsyeni diwendili? Labatyanu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Dimani adimabwaghu na barungitsi ba mandaghu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">yike dine diwarisi nziku yibughe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Nim 118.22</ref></char></note>?”<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Wotsu oduku dibaku mu dimani dyeni, oberughe na otsungughe. Djandi awu dimani dyeni dyubonduyile, onyighemughe.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ghabusilanu Sesare abivu byandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Milonzi mi mighaghe na bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu bakerombange nane borungulile wughange Djesu mumbari bamatasaange yiri djowu, Djesu amatsokiyilaange mu nongu eni. Tumbe basamamughaange mumbari bamadumange mughungi.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu na dyambu dyufute lepu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mrk 12.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Batu bamabe numi-numi na Djesu. Bakemutindile batu abamafuraange ube basatsi ba Nzambi. Batu beni bamarombaange ubaghule batonu mu malongi ma Djesu mu umughange, na umuwakise ombu yidjeti yi baRome mu umusosise. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Batu beni abamatindu, bakemuwivule yivu rye: «Mulonzi, twidjabi yiri wivosi nolonze na dusungughu; wughévayi dupasu va ghari batu, tumbe wilonzi na ngenze nzile Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Tutsinguli nine vo nesi, diwelimine mu ufute lepu ombu Kaghe Sesare?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Tumbe Djesu anobaghule dyele adi mbé bamusoghe, akebawaghule rye: <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>«Mbeyilyanu fure. Yinzi yi nyi? Na dine di nyi bisonughu mu fure eni?» Bakemuwaghule rye: «Bi Kaghe Sesare.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Djesu amabatsingule rye: «Ghabusilanu Kaghe Sesare abivu abyandi, mbana abi Nzambi, bi Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Djowu bamakambulu mu posulu tsyandi na basamadile tonu mu umuveghe mbele. Bakevole «swii».<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">BaSadisi béwivuli Djesu mu durambughulu du abafu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mrk 12.18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Dighuki di baSadisi abamabe na bakemi mu durambughulu du abafu, banobambene na Djesu, bakemuwivulaange rye: <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>«Mulonzi, Moyise, mu mighaghe mi Nzambi, amatusoniyile rye: “Dibaale adiwele, payi aghaabure, yike efu, ngebi andi obyalile mukwili na bobure va yivinze yi awu amafu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Det 25.5-6</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Vamabe yisambwali yi baane ba ngudji ba babaale. Awuteghe akewele na akefu, asamabure. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Nduke tsomi [akewele mukwili, akefu djandi wandi asamabure.] <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Awu muryeru akemwébyalile mukwili eni, akefu djandi wandi, asamabure. Mu yisambwali yotsu ayi mabyalile mukwili, yikefu, yi samasile baane. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>O nzitu, mughetu wandi akefu. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Yilumbu ayi babaale beni borambuyile o dufu, anyi obe mulumi mughetu eni? Mumbari amabe mughatsi djowu botsu.»<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Mu butambe bwébubu, baghetu na babaale béwelisini, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>tumbe bamosi abe Nzambi elabi yiri bawelimine mu urambughe o dufu nodile monyu awurughe, djowu baghomwéwele. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Kaboghu, dufu mbé dughobwébabembe, mumbari bobe nane byanze bi Nzambi. Djowu bobe baane ba Nzambi, na djandi obarambuse o dufu nobaveghe monyu. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Moyise amavose kengili yiri Nzambi orambuse abafu. Ave amavosile mu yilombi yi yivale yi mudji Nzambi, amanengile Fumu “Nzambi dji Aberaame, Nzambi dji Yisaake na Nzambi dji Sakobe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:2">Ukm 3.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:6">6</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Agha Nzambi dji bamvumbi, tumbe Nzambi adji djowu abavu monyu, mumbari djowu badji monyu dibandu djandi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Dighuki di milonzi mi mighaghe baketsingule Djesu rye: «Mulonzi, wutsivose dingenze.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Na djowu, basamamwérungule umuwivule bivu bisusu.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Batu béwivuli Djesu mu dyambu di Davide</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mrk 12.35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Djesu akewivule milonzi mi mighaghe rye: «Dibandu yi batu bévosili rye: “Kirisete, adji mwane Davide?” <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Davide etubuli djabeni mu mughande Nyimbu rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Fumu Nzambi etsinguli Fumu ami rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Tsane va mabaale mami,<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>tena nyukutighe bambeni baghu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">otsi makulu maghu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nim 110.1</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Payi Davide enengili Yibyatsi yi Nzambi “Fumu andi”, ka tsyeni omwébile mwane andi?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu elubusi milonzi mi mighaghe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrk 12.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Mughungi wotsu wunobe limbe mu umuwululu, Djesu aketsingule badukitsi bandi rye: <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«Kebenanu na milonzi mi mighaghe, djowu aberondingi bu uyenelingaange mu bikutu bisakeme, djowu aberondingi usimbungu na dighobe mu mambure ma mighungi, djowu aberondingi utsane mu bitsighe abiteghe mu mandaghu ma tsambu na mbure tsi mimengu amineni, <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>djowu bédyongi nodayile bakwili, djowu bévayi tsambu tsisakeme mu ukelase yiri basungeme. Mu tonu adjine, Nzambi obakilisi pwele uvyoghulile bamosi.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Peghulu dji mukwili wu yidjaghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Ave Djesu amabile o ghari ndaghu Nzambi, anoghengile batu abamasunzaange myenzili myowu, amalabe bisine abimapodulaange myowu mu yevi. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Akebwélabe mukwili awuvu yidjaghe, djawandi amayisunzange doli bedji mu yevi yeni. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Djesu amavose rye: «Ngenze nyidutsinguli, yidjaghe yi mukwili éwuwu, atsivyoghulile botsu uveghe. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Payi nyivosi nane, mumbari bisine byeni, bamapodulaange mbongu atsimabe tsibavyoghulile. Tumbe mukwili ewune, mu budjaghe bwandi, atsipodule byotsu abimabe nandi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebeyi dupanzu du ndaghu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mrk 13.1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Ave mwa batu bamavosilaange nonyungile ndaghu Nzambi, adjimarungusu na mamani mabwedji na bime abimaveghungu ombu Nzambi, Djesu akevose rye: <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>«Bilumbu byurughe, byotsu bine dwinyungili, byupanzu, va ghosyale ne dimani va djulu dimani nandi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bilimbe bimasukusulu ma bulongu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mrk 13.3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Djowu bamamuwivule rye: «Mulonzi, temu yi mambu meni molabenine? Na yilimbe yi, tudjabile yiri mambu memane makilabene na mapape?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Dukebene yiri batu bakedudunze. Mumbari bapwele borughe mu dine dyami na boyidufure yiri “Menu la Kirisete” na “Temu adji Nzambi amasikighe djikebebeli.” Tumbe duyabaduke. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Ave duwululu nduku mavite, duyabe na ghome, mumbari mambu motsu mane mbé molelabene. Tumbe, tsi yiri disukusulu di bulongu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Na amamwébatsingule rye: «Malongu na malongu motoghe; bulongu na bukaghe butoghe. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Butambe wandi buregheme, na mu mambure mapwele, vobe bivunge na dungosu du nzale, vobe mambu mavure, ameveyi ghome noreyimise, na bilimbe bimuvingu byulabene o djulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Tumbe, ne motsu mane makelabene, boledughaange, bakedutsoyise na boduwakise va makake ma bivunde bi mandaghu ma tsambu ma baSwife, bakedukotise o tsughu, bodubeghe va wusu bakaghe na va wusu bidjeti. Boduvayile motsu mane dibandu dine dyami. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Moni moduvaghulu mumbari dukebe bambedji bami. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Banu na duvotsu mu mirime myenu na duyadume mu motsu ameduyevose mu ukekaghule. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Mumbari mebeni nyuduveghe bighume na dyele adi bavinitsi benu baghorungule ughaghene vo udukalile. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Djenu, dusumbusu tangudji na biburu byenu, vo baane ba ngudji benu vo na botsu ba yibandu yenu na bambatsi benu. Batu beni boboke bapwele va ghari enu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Djenu, duvinu na botsu dibandu dine dyami. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Tumbe ne dunange dumosi mu myuru myenu doghodokughe. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Ladibandu, mu duwarulu dwenu, dughobule myonyu myenu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebiyi dupanzu du musyengi Serusaleme</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mrk 13.14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>Djesu amabatsingule rye: «Ave dulabile baghore ba bambeni ukande Serusaleme, djabanu yiri dutsyemughulu dwandi duke beli. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Kaboghu, botsu abobe o yinange yi Sudé barini o mikongu, abobe va ngangele Serusaleme bapali. Djowu abobe mu misiru, bayaghabughe o mimbu. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Mumbari, mu temu eni, mukilu Nzambi wudughusu mu motsu nane Bisonu byandi bivosili. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Kamune maghughe-ma ombu baghetu abobe na mimi na djowu abonwisaange mu temu eni, mumbari bulongu bube mu manyoni maneni na kabu Nzambi djulabene va ghari mukute eni. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Bapwele boboku na didjenge, bamosi bobongu nobeghu nane bavighe, mu misyengi myotsu. Na malongu masusu amaghedjabi Nzambi, monighe Serusaleme tena temu owu djusuke.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Durughulu du Mwane Mutu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mrk 13.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>Djesu amamwévose rye: «Volabene bilimbe mu nyangu, mu tsungi na mu bambwelili. Malongu motsu, mu butambe mobe na keri dibandu nduku neni dji mibidji mi mubu. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Batu boghangu na ghome neni, ave botasilaange adyodyulabene mu butambe, mumbari Nzambi okungise byotsu na mbulighe neni djube o djulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Mbana, bolabe Mwane Mutu eruyi na mangolu na bundumbe va ghari madudumbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Ave mambu meni molabenine, waranu na nangulanu myuru myenu, mumbari dudjeghusu dwenu duke bebeli.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongu dji mwiri bafighe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mrk 13.28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Mbana Djesu akebabukile nongu rye: «Ghengilatyanu mwiri bafighe na miri misusu. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Ave mifulili, dwidjabi yiri temu mvule djikebebeli. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Munongu mosi, ave dulabile mambu meni, djabanu yiri na mapape Nzambi oyibyame nane kaghe. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Ngenze, nyidutsinguli rye: dukulu dwedudu, dugholefu payi motsu mane, makalabene. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Djulu na butambe byuvyoghe, tumbe bighume byami bighovyoghe “vyaa”.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dibandu dyumoghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>Djesu amamwévose rye: «Lubughanu, duyasingene na mimengu, na malangi na manyoni ma myonyu myenu mumbari dukesutusu mu yilumbu yi mufundu. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Mu yilumbu yeni, batu botsu bosutusu nane banyame o ghari mbuse. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Moghanu na sambilenganu Nzambi temu tsyotsu mumbari, dukebe na mangolu morinine mambu motsu marange, na ave Mwane Mutu oruyile, akidurasunu duware.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Ave nyangu, Djesu amalonzaange batu o ghari ndaghu Nzambi. Tumbe, akevyosilaange mukolu o mukongu wu miri mi Olive. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Bilumbu byotsu, batu bamawendaange o ndaghu Nzambi mu uyéwulu malongi ma Djesu.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Sudase eghani kake djusumbise Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mrk 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">San 11.45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Temu mumengu mape maghambu dufunusu, winengulu Pake, djimabambenaange. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na milonzi mi mighaghe bamarombaange uboke Djesu, tumbe bamabe na ghome mughungi. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Dyabu akekote o murime Sudase, omanengulungu Yikalyote, djandi amabangaange mu yinombu yi dighumi na badukitsi babedji (12). <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Sudase amawende mu uyéwulusunu na bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na bivunde bi baghore abamakelisaange ndaghu Nzambi mu udjabe nane ovayile mu usumbise Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Bivunde bakebase na nzangu, bakewulusunu mu umuveghe mbongu. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Sudase akesinge, akerombaange temu nane obawakisile Djesu ne yinombu yi batu yikedjabe.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu erumi dutsonzughulu du mumengu Pake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mat 26.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Mrk 14.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Yilumbu yi mumengu mape magha dufunusu, ayi mbé bobokile mwane yindombu wu mumengu Pake, yimatole. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Djesu akesindighe Pyere na San, akebatsingule rye: «Wendanu, ye tutsonzilanu mulambu Pake, tukidji.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Pyere na San bakemuwivule rye: «Wuke wirondi tuketsonziyile mulambu eni?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Djesu abamawaghule rye: «Wulwanu, ave dukotile mu musyengi, dubengune na mutu eyenebeghe tsuve mambe, mudukyanu o ndaghu adji oyekote. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Mbana tsingulanu mungo ndaghu rye: “Mulonzi atsitusindighe ombu aghu, wuketulase yibuku yi ndaghu ayi djandi na badukitsi bandi bolile mulambu Pake.” <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Djandi odulase yibuku yi ndaghu ndeki yeneni yitsonzughu kale, avane duvayile mulambu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Badukitsi banowende, bakerasune bime byotsu bitsonzughu nane Djesu amabatsingulile na bakelambe mulambu Pake.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulambu wu Fumu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-30">Mat 26.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-26">Mrk 14.17-26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-26">San 13.21-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Temu djinotole, Djesu na bilumbi byandi bakevyoghe va tavule mu udji.<figure style="fig" alt="Mulambu wu Fumu" file="WA03910b.tif" size="col" loc="22.14-23" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="22.14"/> <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Djesu akebatsingule rye: «Nyitsirondaange pwele uledji mulambu éwuwu Pake nenu ne ngatsoghe. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Dingenze nyidutsinguli, ngobwéwudji tena yilumbu ayi Nzambi obwévayile mulambu eni o bukaghe bwandi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Akebonge dimoyi di malamu ma milunde mi vinye, akeghabusile Nzambi diboti, akevose rye: «Bonganu dimoyi dyédidi; mutu-mutu anwangi. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Nyidutsinguli yiri ubandile na muni, ngomwenu malamu memame ma vinye tena yilumbu ayi Bukaghe bu Nzambi buruyile.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Akemwébonge dipe, anoghabusile Nzambi diboti, akedibukule, akeghabile bilumbi byandi na akebatsingule rye: «Dipe dyédidi, dunyuru dwami aduvaghulu mu yibile yenu. Djanu mumbari duketangiminaange.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Banomane udji dipe, Djesu akemwébawakise dimoyi na akevose rye: «Dimoyi dyédidi, dinonge adighone na Nzambi mumbari malungu mami mowiteme mu djenu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Kaboghu, djabanu yiri mutu owunzumbise, adji netu vave tavule. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Ngenze, nenane Mwane Mutu ofwile mu duvangu du Nzambi, kamune maghughe mutu owumusumbise olabe!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Badukitsi bakebande wuwivusenaange: «Anyi va ghari etu orunguse uvaghe dyambu nane dine?»<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyi avu yivunde va ghari badukitsi?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mat 18.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:25-28">Mat 20.25-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mrk 9.34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Va djulu vane, badukitsi bakemwébe na mutsundu wuneni, mu udjabe anyi va ghari owu orungule ube yivunde ayughobusu. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Djesu akebatsingule rye: «Bakaghe ba malongu masusu bérumisi nodyamise batu ba misyengi myowu. Nane bivunde abivu na musughe mu djowu bérondi unengulungu: “Bambatsi ba mughungi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Duyabe nane djowu. Tumbe, oyirondi ube yivunde va ghari enu, mbé okesunze nane mwane ngebi; mbana oyirondi urumise, mbé okevaghule nane musalitsi bambatsi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Kaboghu, anyi avu yivunde, djandi wune odjivu va tavule vo djandi oyikevaghule mu usalile bambatsi? Tsi djandi wune odjivu va metse? Tumbe menu, nyidji va ghari enu nane musalitsi. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Djenu, dudji djowu bane abatsiware nami mu purulu. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Ladibandu menu, nyiduveyili musughe wu urume Bukaghe bu Nzambi nane Tate ami ambyatsile. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Nyivayile nane, mumbari dukedji, nonu va metse mami mu bukaghe bwami. Na dutsanusu mu bitsighe bi bukaghe mu utabule bunzonzi bu dighumi na bifumbe bibedji bi mukute Yisrayele.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyere eghali Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mrk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">San 13.36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Djesu akenengile Simu Pyere: «Simu, Simu, wulu: lanu, Dyabu erondi wudumange djenu botsu nane bésayili uresi mukakesene bipupu na misu. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Tumbe menu, nyitsisambile mu ndedju mumbari yitu yaghu yikedede. Na ndedju, mu yilumbu ayiwughabusile dinonge nami, warise baane ba tadji baghu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Pyere akemutsingule rye: «Fumu, nyitsonzeme uwende naghu o tsughu tena o dufu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Djesu akemuwaghule rye: «Ndedju Pyere, nyighutsinguli: na muni, ne koku akevose, wukale kumbu yiryeru bwena wughenzyabi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbongu, komi na didjenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Mbana, Djesu akebawivule rye: «Ave nyimadusindiyili nenane nyisamaduveghe mbongu, komi vo bapondu, dumaghambu na yime?» Badukitsi bakewaghule rye: «Vyaaghe.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Yike Djesu akebatsingule rye: «Avave, wotsu avu na mbongu abongi, dedi mosi awu avu na komi, abongi na wotsu awu aghaane didjenge, asumbisi yidjungi yandi mu usumbe didjenge. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Nyidutsinguli, nane Bisonu bi Nzambi bivosili mu menu: “Mutu éwuwu amatalu va ghari bikongu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53.12</ref></char></note>.” Kaboghu dyambu adivu adyami, dike beli nolabene.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Badukitsi bakemutsingule rye: «Fumu, tune madjenge mabedji.» Djesu akewaghule rye: «Avotsu, amane mawelimine.»<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu eyésambile o mukongu wu baOlive</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mrk 14.32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Djesu anopale o musyengi, mu yuku yandi, akewende o mukongu wu baOlive. Badukitsi bandi bakemuduke. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Ave bamatolile va mbure eni, Djesu akebatsingule rye: «Sambilanu mumbari dukebe mu dumangu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Djesu akekakene mwa pesu nowu, akekutume, akebande usambile. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>Amavose rye: «Tate, payi wirondi, bonge na kakesene dimoyi dyédidi di maghughe nami. Mu dyoni, diyadughusu nane nyirondili, tumbe nane ndedju wirondili.» [<verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Vane-vane, yanze yimosi yimarughe o djulu, mu uyimuwarise. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Djesu, anoghangu na keri, aketsore manyuru. Akebwese usambile na mangolu na dirughume dyandi dikedekaange va butambe nane maberi ma malungu.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Djesu anomane usambile, akeghabughe ombu badukitsi, akebarasune bilu, batsore manyuru na manyonyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Djesu akebasimbule, akebawivule: «Dibandu yi dwiwendili yilu? Relemanu na sambilanu mumbari dukébe mu dumangu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Béghangi Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mrk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">San 18.3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Djesu wuvose mbé akivose, sundile yinombu yi batu yikebarasune. Sudase awu amabe wumosi va ghari dighumi na badukitsi babedji (12), djandi amabe yibeghe ndonge. Akebambene na Djesu, akemubumbe na akemufwife. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Djesu akemuwivule rye: «Sudase, mu ufwife waghu, wisumbisili Mwane Mutu?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Abamasyale na Djesu, ave bamalabile dyodikivyoghe, bakewivule Djesu rye: «Fumu, tupalisi madjenge mu utoghe nowu?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Wumosi va ghari owu, akepalise didjenge, aketabule ditudji di mabaale di musalitsi wu yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Tumbe Djesu akevose rye: «Dundanu, avotsu.» Na amabembe ditudji di musalitsi na akemubeluse.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Mbana Djesu aketsingule bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na bivunde bi baghore na bivunde bi baSwife abamarughe owuyimughaange rye: «Dumarughe na madjenge na mangwangu nane bwena yikongu dwiyighaange. <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Bilumbu byotsu, nyibetsi nenu o ghari ndaghu Nzambi, dughaakangaange. Temu adjidji, djike djenu adji mangolu ma pisime mesalili mukolu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyere eghali Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26.57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mrk 14.53-54</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">San 18.12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Na béghangi Djesu, bakemubeghe o ndaghu yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu. Pyere akenebadukaange va ghegheyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Batu beni, banobanze mudji va ngangele dulombili, Pyere wandi akeyétsane va ghari owu. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Musatsi wumosi wu mughetu wu yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu akemulabe atsane va mughule mudji, akemutsune «pii» na akevose rye: «Dibaale dyédidi wandi abetsi na Djesu!» <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Tumbe Pyere akeghale nomutsingule rye: «Mughetu, menu ngémudjabi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Mwa pesu temu, mutu mosi anomulabe, akemutsingule rye: «Ndewandi, wudji nowu!» Tumbe Pyere akewaghule rye: «Nesi, menu nga nowu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Mwa diweru dinovyoghe, mutu wususu akebwétsiyise bwena: «Nyitasi yiri, dingenze, dibaale dyédidi abetsi nandi mumbari djawandi adji mwise Ngalile.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Pyere akemuwaghule rye: «Ngedjabi adi wirondi uvose.» Ave Pyere amavosilaange, koku wandi novose. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Fumu anoghelughe, yiswisu yandi na yi Pyere bikebengune. Sundile Pyere akerangimine adi Fumu amamutsingule: «Na muni, ne koku akevose, ndedju wukale kumbu yiryeru bwena wughenzyabi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Pyere, anopale o dulombili, amalile «rodoo» na munyongu wotsu.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baghore bésyengi na bédimbe Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mrk 14.65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Batu abamakelisaange Djesu, bamamupedjingi na bamamudimbaange. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Djowu, banomudibighe yinzi bakemuwivulaange rye: «Bighe na tutsinguli anyi atsighudimbe?» <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Na bakebwélaange umusyenge nomutsingulaange mambu mamosi mabive.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu va wusu fundu dji banzonzi ba baSwife</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mrk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">San 18.19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Mune kedi, fundu dji bivunde bi mukute, bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na milonzi mi mighaghe bamaghukume, bakebeghe Djesu va wusu fundu dji banzonzi ba baSwife. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Awune, bakemuwivule rye: «Ndedju, la Kirisete? Tutsinguli.» Djandi akebawaghule rye: «Yike nyidutsinguli, djenu dughosinge. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Payi nyitsiduwivule yivu, djenu dughokwaghule. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Ubandile vave, Mwane Mutu obe atsane o mabaale ma Nzambi-Pungu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.69 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nim 110.1</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Djowu botsu bakeghamughe va mosi rye: «Kaboghu ndedju, wudji Mwane Nzambi?» Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Djenubeni dumatubule: Nine, menu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Bakevose rye: «Twisane nzale bambedji! Djetubeni tumaghulwanu, mambu amatsipale va munu andi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ebeghu va wusu Pilate</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mrk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">San 18.28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Yinombu yotsu yi batu yikereleme, mu ubeghe Djesu va wusu yidjeti bamanengilaange Pilate. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Avane, djowu botsu bamamufwengile na bamatsingule Pilate rye: «Dibaale dyédidi, tutsimurasunu esibisi batu ba bulongu bwetu na ebaghandisi uvane lepu ombu Kaghe Sesare, na evosi yiri djabeni la Kirisete mbana adji Kaghe.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilate akemuwivule rye: «Ndedju la Kaghe baSwife?» Djesu akemuwaghule: «Ndebeni widivosi.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Pilate aketsingule bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na yinombu rye: «Menu ngelabi mbele djufwengiyile mutu éwuwu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Tumbe batu beni bakemwéghamungaange na mangolu rye: «Mu ndonzulu andi, djandi esibisi mukute bakebuse ughobise mighaghe mi kaghe Sesare. Mutu eni atsivaghe nane mu yinange yotsu yi Sudé, ubandile o yinange yi Ngalile, tena wunu tuvwanu.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Ave Pilate amawululu nane, akewivule rye: «Mutu éwuwu, mwise Ngalile?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Batu bakewaghule Pilate bwena Djesu adji mwise Ngalile. Pilate akemutinde ombu kaghe Yirode mwane Atipa. Kaghe adjimarumisaange yinange yi Ngalile na va temu eni, mbé aki o Serusaleme. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Yirode akebase na nzangu ave amalabile Djesu mumbari yilemee amarondaange ubengune nandi. Mumba amawulu didume dyandi na amatasaange yiri Djesu omulase mwa yimaghe. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Yirode akemuwivule pwele bivu, tumbe Djesu asamamuwaghule ne yimosi. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Vane mbure eni, bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na milonzi mi mighaghe bamabe djowu andi na kabu, bakemufwengiyilaange pwele mambu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Yirode na baghore bandi bakepedjingi nosyenge Djesu. Bakemudwise yikutu yi bukaghe na bakemughabuse ombu Pilate. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Vane kale Yirode na Pilate bamabangaange bambeni, tumbe mu yilumbu yéyine, bakebwéghabusile bumbatsi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu ekilusu mu dufu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mrk 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">San 18.39—19.16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilate akeghukighe bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, bidjeti bimosi na mughungi, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>akebatsingule rye: «Djenu dutsimbeyile dibaale dyédidi na djandi esibisi mukute na kande. Labatyanu, nyitsimusosisile va wusu enu, tumbe ngalabe mbele andi mu mambu ame djenu dwimufwengilili. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Ne Yirode djawandi, aghalabe dibi mu Djesu yiri akeboku. Ladibandu atsimughabusile ombu etu. Mutu éwuwu aghaane dyambu adyumurombise dufu. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Kaboghu nyurume bakemudimbise bwandi na batsilu mbana bakemudunde.» [<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Mu kadi mumengu Pake, Pilate amabangaange na yufu yupalisaange mwise tsughu wumosi.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Tumbe yinombu ayimabe vane, wikeghamughe va mosi rye: «Bokise dibaale dyédidi, tupalisili Barabase.» <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Mu disibise adi Barabase amarombise mu musyengi eni, na uboke awu amabokile mutu, adine dimamukotise o tsughu. <verse eid="LUK 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilate, mu nzale udunde Djesu, akemwébawivule adi mubedji. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Tumbe mughungi wukebwéghamughe na mangolu: «Mughomini, mughomini va kurusu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilate akemwébawivule adi muryeru rye: «Dibi dika, mutu éwuwu atsivaghe? Ngelabi dyambu adi djandi obokulu. Menu, nyumudimbise wandi mbana, nyumudunde.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Tumbe mughungi wukebwelaange ughamughe o djulu yiri Djesu aghomunu va kurusu. Yike mu posulu owu, dufu du Djesu dukesikughu. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Vane-vane, Pilate akesinge adi mughungi wumarondaange. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Pilate akebapalisile mutu awubamavondaange awu amasunzu o tsughu dibandu disibise na bukongu bwandi, na akebawakise Djesu bakemuvaghe adi bamarondaange.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu eghomunu va kurusu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mrk 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">San 19.17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Ave bamabeyilaange Djesu, bakebengune na dibaale dinengulu Simu mwise musyengi Sirene amarughesenaange o manungi. Baghore bakemusikighe na bakemughome yiri akenangule kurusu mbana akenedukaange Djesu va nzime. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Yinombu yineni yi batu yikenebadukaange. Va ghari mughungi eni vakebe mwa dighuki di baghetu bamenelilaange nonyongaange dibandu mukilu wu Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Djesu akebaghengile na akebatsingule rye: «Baghetu ba Serusaleme, duyalile mu menu, lilenganu mu djenubeni na mu baane benu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Lanu, bilumbu byurughe ave batu bovosilaange rye: “Ubwedji ombu bingume, ombu djowu abasekalebure na djowu abasamanwise.” <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Mu temu eni, batu bovosaange na mikongu na milandu yiri: “Tuvikyanu na tughumbyanu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Ose 10.8</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Labatyanu, mu mwiri awu monyu bamavaghe mambu mabive, ka mu mukanzu, tsyeni bovayile?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Vane-vane, bakebeghe bikongu bibedji bakiboku va mosi na Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Ave bamatolile va mbure adjimanengulungu «Dubengili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dubengili: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bivisi bi muru bi mutu vo bi yibulu yifu.</char></note>», baghore bakeghomine Djesu va kurusu. Yike bakeghomine bikongu byeni mu tsyowu kurusu, wumosi o mabaale, awune o maghetu mandi.<figure style="fig" alt="Djesu eghomunu va kurusu" file="WA03926b.tif" size="col" loc="23.26-33" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="23.33"/> <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>[Mwa pesu temu, Djesu akevose rye: «Tate, batandi mumbari baghedjabi adi bévayi.»] Baghore beni bakesole mutu mu udjabe anyi odile yikutu yi Djesu. Mu uyidile, bakevaghe dusolu du yese. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Mughungi wumabe wughukeme na wukeghengilaange. Tumbe bivunde bi baSwife, bakepedjingi Djesu na bakevosange rye: «Amaghobule basusu, tsyé akeghobuli djabeni payi adji Kirisete awu Nzambi amasole!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Baghore wandi bakebambene, bakemupedjingi na Bakemuveghe dingibe dingani akenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Bakevose rye: «Payi wudji Kaghe baSwife, tsyékeghobule ndebeni!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Mu yasi yi dusimbi ayimaghomunu va kurusu o djulu muru andi, bamasonighe: «Awuwu, Kaghe baSwife.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Yikongu yimosi ayimaghomunu va kurusu va mughule Djesu, akemubangulaange novose rye: «Ndedju, meta wudji Kirisete? Tsyékeghobule ndebeni na tughobuli!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Yikongu ayi mubedji ayimaghomunu wandi mu djandi kurusu, akesyembe mbatsi na akemutsingule rye: «Nenane wutsiveghulu mukilu nane mutu éwuwu, ndedju wughédumi Nzambi? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Mu djetu naghu, tuwelimine mudile fute édjidji mu mambu ame tumavaghe. Tumbe djandi, aghavaghe dyambu dibi.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Mbana yikongu yeni akevose rye: «Djesu, wuyandibene ave wuruyile mu uyibyame nane kaghe.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Vane-vane, Djesu akemuwaghule rye: «Dingenze nyighutsinguli, na muni, wukote nami o Bukaghe bu Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dufu du Djesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mrk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">San 19.28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Va mwangulu, nyangu djikevole na pisime djikedughunu mu butambe bwotsu tena murekemunu wu wisi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Dimengi di nyangu dinotsyemughe, pisime djikebase mu butambe, dumbu du mbure adji Syeme va dikotulu di ndaghu Nzambi dukepasighe va ghari. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Djesu akeghamughe mughamu wuneni, akevose rye: «Tate, nyiwakisi Yinyuni yami va makake maghu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:6">Nim 31.6</ref></char></note>.» Anomane uvose nane, akefu. <verse eid="LUK 23:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Yivunde yi baghore anolabe adimavyoghe, akedodise Nzambi novose: «Dingenze, mutu éwuwu abetsi asungeme.» <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Yinombu yi batu yimarughe pwele, yinolabe adimavyoghe, yikeneghabughe mu mimbu mowu, bakene dumange batulu dibandu munyongu wuneni mu mirime. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Bambatsi botsu ba Djesu na baghetu abamawendaange nandi, ubongile o Ngalile, bamabe bavengeme djowu mbure na bakeghengilaange nane mambu mamavyoyilaange.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sosefu esunzi dunyuru du Djesu o ngile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mrk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">San 19.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51"/>Vamabe mutu dine dyandi Sosefe, amabe na musighe, asungeme, akevivaange durughulu du Bukaghe bu Nzambi. Djandi, amabe yivunde wandi va ghari fundu dji banzonzi ba baSwife na amabe mwise musyengi wu Arimate mu yinange yi Sudé. Asamasobene ditase na bambatsi mu uboke Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Dibaale dyeni, akewende, mu uyélabe yidjeti Pilate, akemuveghe musughe mu ubonge dunyuru du Djesu. Pilate akemugharusu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Sosefe akesunduse dunyuru du Djesu va kurusu, akedupote va tsande na akedusunze o ngile adjimatimu o ghari tali o mbé wukatswighulu mutu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Amadivaghe, mu yilumbu ayiduki yilumbu ayireli yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife, ayi batu basamasalilaange. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Baghetu abamenedukaange Djesu, ubongile o Ngalile, bakesobene konge na Sosefe na bakewende o ngile. Awune bamalabe nane bamasunzile dunyuru du Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Banomane, bakeghabughe mu mandaghu, muyetsonzighe matsi na miyombu muyeghotse dunyuru du Djesu. Djowu, bamaghobise mughaghe awighandisi baSwife usale mu yilumbu yuvume.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Djesu erambuyi o dufu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mrk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">San 20.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Mu yilumbu yiteghe yitsone, va matebughulu ma wisi, baghetu bamawende o ngile na birure bi matsi na miyombu ami bamatsonzighe. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Ave bamatolile, bakerasunu dimani adi bamakibiyile ngile dimavengughu va mughule. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Bakekote, basamarasunu dunyuru du Fumu Djesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Baghetu, bakesutu. Sundile, babaale babedji badware bikutu bikadimi, bakelabene va wusu owu.<figure style="fig" alt="Djesu erambuyi o dufu" file="WA03931b.tif" size="col" loc="24.1-7" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="24.4"/> <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Baghetu, bakeghangu na ghome, baketsokighe misu na tsi. Babaale beni bakebawivule rye: «Dibandu yi dwirombili odjivu monyu va ghari djowu abamafu? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Asa vave, tumbe amarambughe o dufu. Kaboghu, rangiminanu ame amadutsingulanga ave mbé akivu o Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>Avane, amavosaange rye: “Diwelimine yiri Mwane Mutu owakusu va makake ma bavayitsi ba mabi, oghomunu va kurusu, mbana mu yilumbu ayimuryeru, orambughe o dufu”.»<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Vane-vane, baghetu beni bamarangimine mambu ame Djesu amabatsingulaange. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Banoghusughe o ngile, bakeghabughe muyetsingule dighumi na yilumbi yimosi na badukitsi botsu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Mu yinombu yi baghetu beni, vamabe Mari mwise musyengi wu Maghedale, Sane na Mari ngudji Sake, na baghetu bamosi. Djowu bane, abamayétsingule bilumbi nane bamayerasunine o ngile. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Tumbe bilumbi byeni baketasange yiri motsu ame baghetu bamabatsingule, amofure na basamamavayile yitu. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Vane-vane, Pyere akereleme, akatiremughe mbangu nowende o ngile. Anodokemine, akelabe yike matsande vatsi, na akeghabughe o ndaghu andi, akekambulu mu dyambu adi amayerasunu o ngile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Badukitsi babedji mu nzile Yimayise</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mrk 16.12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Mune yilumbu yeni, badukitsi babedji bamawende o musyengi Yimayise, dimbu dimabe dikakene mu dighumi na take bedji na Serusaleme. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Djowu bakenevosange mu mambu motsu amamavyoghe. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Ave bamenevosilaange notsunde mu mambu meni, Djesu akebambene na akesobene konge nowu. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Batu beni bamamulabaange, tumbe Nzambi akebavaghe muvuyisini yiri bakemujabe. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Djesu akebawivule rye: «Dyambu yi dwiyenetsundile mu nzile?» Djowu, bakesikeme na munyongu wotsu. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Wumosi va ghari owu, enengilu Kolopase, akemuwaghule rye: «Bu ndedju pinze awitsani va musyengi Serusaleme awughadjabe motsu amatsivyoghe mu bilumbu byébibi?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Djesu akebawaghule rye: «Ayii?» Djowu botsu bakemukanzuyile rye: «Dyambu aditsivyoghe mu Djesu mwise Nasarete. Amabe mubiyitsi wuneni avosange na mangolu nodughusungu bisalu bineni, va wusu Nzambi na va wusu batu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na bidjeti byetu, bamamusumbise yiri akekilusu na akeghomunu va kurusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Djetu botsu mbé tukane yitu bwena djandi o mbé oyighobule mukute Yisrayele. Tumbe labatyanu, yilumbu ayiyi yike yi muryeru, mambu memane mamalabenine. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Dingenze, baghetu bamosi va ghari etu, bamatusutusu ave bamawendile kedi neni o ngile. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Banotole, basamarasunu yibindi yi Djesu. Bakeghabughe, bakebeghe tsangu bwena Byanze bitsibatsingule yiri Djesu adji monyu. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Ladibandu, babaale bamosi abamabe netu, bamawendile djowandi o ngile, bakérasunu nane baghetu bamayitutsingulile bwena basamalabe yibindi yandi.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Djesu akevose nowu rye: «Dughejabi dyambu, durange usinge, na mirime myenu mighale, mu ughangise motsu ame babiyitsi bamadutsingule! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Diwelimine yiri Kirisete mbé oletsoghusu ne akekote mu bundumbe bwandi.» <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Vane-vane, Djesu akebande ubatsingule motsu ame Bisonu bi Nzambi bimavose mu djabeni: ubongile mu mighande mi Moyise tena mu Bisonu bi babiyitsi botsu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Yike bebi bebeli na dimbu adi bamawendaange, Djesu akevaghe nane djandi evyoyi kwase. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Mubedji ewune, bamamughome nomutsingule rye: «Wisi wumatsime, sikeme wukevyose mukolu netu.» Djesu amakote nowu o ndaghu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Ave bamavyoyile va metse, Djesu akebonge dipe, akeghabusile Nzambi diboti, akedibukule na akebaveghe. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Vane-vane, misu mowu mamadibughe na bamamudjabe. Tumbe Djesu akesundile, utsyemughe va wusu owu. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Badukitsi beni bakewivusunaange rye: «Tutsighulungu nane yusile mu mirime myetu ave atsiyene tuvosilaange mu nzile, na ave atsiyene tuvindiyilaange Bisonu bi Nzambi!» <verse eid="LUK 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Badukitsi beni, bakereleme, bakesogheme o Serusaleme. Bakeye rasune dighumi na yilumbi yimosi na badukitsi botsu abamabe baghukeme nowu. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Banobarasune, baketsingule badukitsi babedji rye: «Ame tutsighulu mangenze, Fumu adji monyu! Dingenze, atsilabene na Simu!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Badukitsi babedji bakemwébatsingule adimalabe mu nzile na nane bamadjabile Djesu ave amabukulile dipe.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu elabini na dighumi na yilumbi yimosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mrk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">San 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bis 1.6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Ave bamavosilaange, Djesu djabeni akesundile upale va ghari owu na akebatsingule rye: «Duvotsu dubi nenu!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Banoghangu na keri, baketsaghemughe, mumbari bamatasaange yiri ditengu dimapale va ghari owu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Tumbe Djesu, akebawivule rye: «Dibandu yi, dwitsaghemuyili na mumbari yi, dubile na bakemi mu mirime myenu bwena nyidji monyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Ghengilanu makake na matambi mami: dughélabi bwena menu? Ghengilanu na mbembyanu, ditengu aghaane dunyuru nane menu.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Anobatsingule nane, akebalase makake na matambi mandi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Djowu ne nane basamalesinge, dibandu nzangu na usutu awu bamasutu. Djesu akebawivule rye: «Avave, dughaane mwa yighudji yi udji?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Bakemuveghe yibuku yi nyame mambe djighoku na yasi yi yisile yi budji. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Djesu akeyibonge, akeyidji va misu mowu. <verse eid="LUK 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Mbana, akebatsingule rye: «Lanu, adi nyimadutsingulaange mbé ngi va ghari enu: mambu motsu amamasonughu mu menu mu mughaghe wu Moyise, mu bisonu bi babiyitsi na mu mughande Nimbu, mbé moledughusu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Yike Djesu, akebadibule dudjabu, mumbari bakewulu notsiyise Bisonu bi Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Mbana akemwébatsingule rye: «Disonughu yiri Kirisete, otsoghusu na mu yilumbu ayimuryeru, osimbughe va ghari djowu abafu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53">Isa 53</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:2">Ose 6.2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Mu malongu motsu, ubandile o musyengi Serusaleme, musamu wu dukalusu du mutsanu na wu dutandulu du mabi ma batu, mbé wusamunu mu dine dyandi. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Djenubeni, dudji bambedji ba mambu meni. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Tumbe menu, nyudutindile pangini adji Tate ami amadulonge. Kaboghu, tsananu vave musyengi éwuwu tena dubase na mangolu ameruyi o djulu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu emati o djulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mrk 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bis 1.9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Djesu akebabeghe o yari musyengi Betani. Avane, akenangule makake na djulu, akesambile Nzambi na akebaveghe myule. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Ave amabaveyilaange myule, akekakene nowu, akematusu o djulu.<figure style="fig" alt="Djesu emati o djulu" file="WA03935b.tif" size="col" loc="24.50-53" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="24.52"/> <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Badukitsi beni nabemani wumuyitse, bakeghabusile o Serusaleme na nzangu neni. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Na temu tsyotsu bamabengunange va dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi mu umuyitsaange na mu umudodisaange.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
